(1726000, 234179, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think you''re confused...that should be a scarf, not a leaf! Really nice picture, only thing I dont like is the sloping of the shoulders which feels like it takes away some of the impact of the face.</td>', 'I think you''re confused...that should be a scarf, not a leaf! Really nice picture, only thing I dont like is the sloping of the shoulders which feels like it takes away some of the impact of the face.', '2005-09-21 01:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726004, 232863, 4281, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, if only this dark forest hadn''t been in the foreground this would have been a quite nice photograph. :(<br/> <br/>Other than that forest, I like it. Wasn''t it possible for you to take this from a slightly different angle, e.g. more to the left, so you would have been able to leave that forest out of the picture? Or perhaps taking this photo from a higher vantage point?<br/> <br/>Or maybe even reshoot the picture at a later time with the sun at a different angle so the forest wouldn''t be so dark?<br/> <br/>As it is, it''s too much of a ''almost'' picture for my taste. But there is so little missing for it too look really nice.</td>', 'Ooooh, if only this dark forest hadn''t been in the foreground this would have been a quite nice photograph. :( Other than that forest, I like it. Wasn''t it possible for you to take this from a slightly different angle, e.g. more to the left, so you would have been able to leave that forest out of the picture? Or perhaps taking this photo from a higher vantage point? Or maybe even reshoot the picture at a later time with the sun at a different angle so the forest wouldn''t be so dark? As it is, it''s too much of a ''almost'' picture for my taste. But there is so little missing for it too look really nice.', '2005-09-21 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726014, 233765, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE LOVE LOVE this on all levels.  Perfect challenge entry, great lighting, super detail, wonderful contrast!  Man and to boot, it''s a mouse!!!!  THANKS for the smile of the night!</td>', 'LOVE LOVE LOVE this on all levels.  Perfect challenge entry, great lighting, super detail, wonderful contrast!  Man and to boot, it''s a mouse!!!!  THANKS for the smile of the night!', '2005-09-21 01:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726017, 233075, 15711, '<td valign="top">This certainly fits the challenge, but just doesn''t have much pinache. It''s just a hill with some trees and a sign.  Granted it is the most well known sign, but there''s nothing to make me say WOW!  Just got back from the area - I wish I were still there .</td>', 'This certainly fits the challenge, but just doesn''t have much pinache. It''s just a hill with some trees and a sign.  Granted it is the most well known sign, but there''s nothing to make me say WOW!  Just got back from the area - I wish I were still there .', '2005-09-21 01:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726018, 234293, 23430, '<td valign="top">Love the natural plain background</td>', 'Love the natural plain background', '2005-09-21 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726019, 232318, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice change of pace to have a good interior shot for this challenge.  I love the softness. It almost seems to be from another era with the delicate graining. The tones of the flowers and greenery are lovely with the neutral tines of the vase and wall.  Very nice indeed!</td>', 'Nice change of pace to have a good interior shot for this challenge.  I love the softness. It almost seems to be from another era with the delicate graining. The tones of the flowers and greenery are lovely with the neutral tines of the vase and wall.  Very nice indeed!', '2005-09-21 01:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
