(1726545, 234564, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture and the fact that you have multi-tones of green in the background, not flat black or white. I love the contrast of the rusty metal with the bird''s coloring.  Minor quibble, to slavishly follow the Rule of Thirds, I think you should have shifted the bird and his perch over, up, and to the left.  I think it would balance the picture better, but now that I look at the picture again, maybe not.</td>', 'I really like this picture and the fact that you have multi-tones of green in the background, not flat black or white. I love the contrast of the rusty metal with the bird''s coloring.  Minor quibble, to slavishly follow the Rule of Thirds, I think you should have shifted the bird and his perch over, up, and to the left.  I think it would balance the picture better, but now that I look at the picture again, maybe not.', '2005-09-21 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
