(1726566, 233006, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh cool! I like the solid blue of the shot and the outstretched hand over the water. Very clever. Maybe a bit boring, but the idea is so original and the blues are so pretty, that it makes up for it.  A for originality!!!</td>', 'Oh cool! I like the solid blue of the shot and the outstretched hand over the water. Very clever. Maybe a bit boring, but the idea is so original and the blues are so pretty, that it makes up for it.  A for originality!!!', '2005-09-21 10:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726574, 232333, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too bad the musician was wearing a dark shirt.  He blends into the background so much that it looks like two forearms, legs, and a guitar.  I think you needed more light on this one.</td>', 'Too bad the musician was wearing a dark shirt.  He blends into the background so much that it looks like two forearms, legs, and a guitar.  I think you needed more light on this one.', '2005-09-21 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726576, 233765, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute, good photo :)</td>', 'cute, good photo :)', '2005-09-21 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726578, 234535, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  I like this very much.  The blurred stalks of grass in the foreground lead your eye up and then the yellow flower pops out.  Nice.</td>', 'Great DOF.  I like this very much.  The blurred stalks of grass in the foreground lead your eye up and then the yellow flower pops out.  Nice.', '2005-09-21 10:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726581, 234465, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love simple shots like this.  So graphic and the POW of the blue really works here. Deep cobalt glass is so eye catching in any environment and against the solid white - THAT''s pinache!!!</td>', 'I love simple shots like this.  So graphic and the POW of the blue really works here. Deep cobalt glass is so eye catching in any environment and against the solid white - THAT''s pinache!!!', '2005-09-21 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726586, 234264, 16241, '<td valign="top">absorbing photo!</td>', 'absorbing photo!', '2005-09-21 10:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726589, 233952, 15711, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t use a glow filter on this one - with the title and all.  I like the old shack - it certainly suits the challenge criteria, but it lacks a little oomph.  The colors are pretty and complimentary. Hmmm  - I think it''s the logs in the forground like your eye can''t decide if it should rest there or on the building.  The focus is good and it is a definitely well thought out effort.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t use a glow filter on this one - with the title and all.  I like the old shack - it certainly suits the challenge criteria, but it lacks a little oomph.  The colors are pretty and complimentary. Hmmm  - I think it''s the logs in the forground like your eye can''t decide if it should rest there or on the building.  The focus is good and it is a definitely well thought out effort.', '2005-09-21 10:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726590, 232550, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good cat picture.  I think this is a case where you should have broken the Rule of Thirds and just zoomed in on the cat.  IMHO the lower portion of the picture adds nothing, and you could have cropped it out.</td>', 'Good cat picture.  I think this is a case where you should have broken the Rule of Thirds and just zoomed in on the cat.  IMHO the lower portion of the picture adds nothing, and you could have cropped it out.', '2005-09-21 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726594, 234156, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Beautiful colors and though normally I personally prefer ''natural environment'' flower/plant shots (this looks like studio, but forgive me if I am wrong), the black background is excellent here, especially mixing with the blue, which you have captured well.  Criticism; ''if only'' those few fore ''anthers'' were in focus, would make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps more of the petals bottom right too, like the ones bottom left, but then that may detract from that central focus on the blue ''stigmas''(?).  Like the bit of pollen on the petal upper right too.  Good ''rule(s)'' too.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Beautiful colors and though normally I personally prefer ''natural environment'' flower/plant shots (this looks like studio, but forgive me if I am wrong), the black background is excellent here, especially mixing with the blue, which you have captured well.  Criticism; ''if only'' those few fore ''anthers'' were in focus, would make this much better in my opinion.  Perhaps more of the petals bottom right too, like the ones bottom left, but then that may detract from that central focus on the blue ''stigmas''(?).  Like the bit of pollen on the petal upper right too.  Good ''rule(s)'' too.', '2005-09-21 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726597, 233901, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love goats.  I wish his face were a tad more focused.  With the placement of the eyes, they are in the intersection grid that fits the rule of thirds.  Good DOF.  Makes me think of that old kids'' story The Three Billy Goats Gruff. :~)</td>', 'Love goats.  I wish his face were a tad more focused.  With the placement of the eyes, they are in the intersection grid that fits the rule of thirds.  Good DOF.  Makes me think of that old kids'' story The Three Billy Goats Gruff. :~)', '2005-09-21 10:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726599, 232478, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good sky and clouds, but the rest of the picture is so dark I can''t tell what it is.  IMHO the black border just drags everything down.</td>', 'Good sky and clouds, but the rest of the picture is so dark I can''t tell what it is.  IMHO the black border just drags everything down.', '2005-09-21 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726606, 234017, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  The sand almost looks like boulders here.  The eye is in perfect placement of the grid of the horizontal and vertical lines in the rule of thirds.  Not the most interesting shot with the color scheme, but a good effort nonetheless.  Good detail and clarity on the grasshopper.</td>', 'Great macro.  The sand almost looks like boulders here.  The eye is in perfect placement of the grid of the horizontal and vertical lines in the rule of thirds.  Not the most interesting shot with the color scheme, but a good effort nonetheless.  Good detail and clarity on the grasshopper.', '2005-09-21 10:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726609, 233876, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. I like the bee''s placement - perfect for the rule of thirds.  I think the colors are very nice too. It''s interesting that the blur is to the right yet 2/3 of it is in focus.  Nice.</td>', 'Nice DOF. I like the bee''s placement - perfect for the rule of thirds.  I think the colors are very nice too. It''s interesting that the blur is to the right yet 2/3 of it is in focus.  Nice.', '2005-09-21 10:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726613, 231877, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good composition and meets challenge, but I would have liked to see some detail in the rocks at the right.</td>', 'Good composition and meets challenge, but I would have liked to see some detail in the rocks at the right.', '2005-09-21 10:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726615, 234053, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great colors and capture, congratulations!!!</td>', 'Great colors and capture, congratulations!!!', '2005-09-21 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726617, 233801, 16241, '<td valign="top">this makes me smile :)</td>', 'this makes me smile :)', '2005-09-21 10:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726620, 234164, 16241, '<td valign="top">now we talking!</td>', 'now we talking!', '2005-09-21 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726621, 234600, 35545, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a more powerful image without the ladder in the foreground.  IMHO it overwhelms the shack which has good color and lines by itself.</td>', 'I think this would have been a more powerful image without the ladder in the foreground.  IMHO it overwhelms the shack which has good color and lines by itself.', '2005-09-21 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726622, 232715, 44602, '<td valign="top">what an excellent picture from the shot to the colours - really like this one</td>', 'what an excellent picture from the shot to the colours - really like this one', '2005-09-21 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726627, 234638, 35545, '<td valign="top">I think you could have cut out a lot of the sky.  It takes over the picture.  With cropping, you could still have gotten a good picture in a landscape format.</td>', 'I think you could have cut out a lot of the sky.  It takes over the picture.  With cropping, you could still have gotten a good picture in a landscape format.', '2005-09-21 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726628, 233977, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good use for the challenge but way overexposed.  The blanched out water and background has lost most of it''s color due to the time of day probably. I love the rich tones of the foreground. Maybe shoot in early morning or late evening and you''d really have something. ;~D</td>', 'Good use for the challenge but way overexposed.  The blanched out water and background has lost most of it''s color due to the time of day probably. I love the rich tones of the foreground. Maybe shoot in early morning or late evening and you''d really have something. ;~D', '2005-09-21 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726630, 232302, 16241, '<td valign="top">what where you offering?  :)</td>', 'what where you offering?  :)', '2005-09-21 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726635, 234539, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever. I like the highlights on the hair and her pensive looe.  This has a good use of black and white.  Maybe upturned eyes would have worked a bit better for me.</td>', 'Clever. I like the highlights on the hair and her pensive looe.  This has a good use of black and white.  Maybe upturned eyes would have worked a bit better for me.', '2005-09-21 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726638, 232654, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great skin tones and the nice reflection on her face is pleasant. It does have a snapshot sense to it thought with the distracting items in the background. It suits the challenge well.  This might be a fun study in Black and White as well.</td>', 'Great skin tones and the nice reflection on her face is pleasant. It does have a snapshot sense to it thought with the distracting items in the background. It suits the challenge well.  This might be a fun study in Black and White as well.', '2005-09-21 10:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726639, 234644, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO the picture looks contrived and awkard using the rule of thirds.  Your niece is so pretty, I would have filled up the frame with her.  She has a great expression and the skin tones are lovely.</td>', 'IMHO the picture looks contrived and awkard using the rule of thirds.  Your niece is so pretty, I would have filled up the frame with her.  She has a great expression and the skin tones are lovely.', '2005-09-21 10:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726643, 232863, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and I like the rolling hills with the complimentary blues and greens<br/>This actually works both horizontally and vertically. The white of the wind mills draw your eye to them. Nice.</td>', 'This is interesting and I like the rolling hills with the complimentary blues and greensThis actually works both horizontally and vertically. The white of the wind mills draw your eye to them. Nice.', '2005-09-21 10:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726648, 232900, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The lighting seems a tad harsh with her face in the shadows and she''s squinting.  I wish her shirt weren''t so distracting, with the detailed design and all. I like the balloon. It would have been cool to shoot it so that she is only a silhouette. Original idea though.</td>', 'Great idea.  The lighting seems a tad harsh with her face in the shadows and she''s squinting.  I wish her shirt weren''t so distracting, with the detailed design and all. I like the balloon. It would have been cool to shoot it so that she is only a silhouette. Original idea though.', '2005-09-21 10:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726649, 234642, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the dark band through the middle of the picture kills it for me.</td>', 'Good concept, but the dark band through the middle of the picture kills it for me.', '2005-09-21 10:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726651, 232995, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure.  I wish the colors were a bit more vivid. It would really have some pinache then. I love bicycles. They have a curved AND straight sense to them. Very graphic.</td>', 'Nice long exposure.  I wish the colors were a bit more vivid. It would really have some pinache then. I love bicycles. They have a curved AND straight sense to them. Very graphic.', '2005-09-21 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726653, 232220, 35545, '<td valign="top">Mischief needs to be in focus.  Needs more contrast.  Why the tilt?</td>', 'Mischief needs to be in focus.  Needs more contrast.  Why the tilt?', '2005-09-21 10:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726654, 234420, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty and subtle. I almost wsth the lighting were a bit more intense, with the soft filter and all but maybe that''s my personal taste. I wonder if it would have worked a bit better with a solid background, and not one with folds and movement. I love the rich magenta of the flowers and the single leaf.</td>', 'Pretty and subtle. I almost wsth the lighting were a bit more intense, with the soft filter and all but maybe that''s my personal taste. I wonder if it would have worked a bit better with a solid background, and not one with folds and movement. I love the rich magenta of the flowers and the single leaf.', '2005-09-21 10:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726656, 234297, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful shot, except for the horizon! Just a little bit of clockwise rotation would have made this perfect.</td>', 'This is such a wonderful shot, except for the horizon! Just a little bit of clockwise rotation would have made this perfect.', '2005-09-21 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726657, 234489, 15711, '<td valign="top">Totally monochromatic.  This is good because it sends your eye to the statue instead of a bunch of colors and your eye not having a place to rest.  I might''ve upped the green sat a bit but overall, this is different and quite pleasant.</td>', 'Totally monochromatic.  This is good because it sends your eye to the statue instead of a bunch of colors and your eye not having a place to rest.  I might''ve upped the green sat a bit but overall, this is different and quite pleasant.', '2005-09-21 10:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726659, 233978, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great title!!  I wish there were a bit more coloration in the sunset, but the sun flare is well achieved and not too "bright." The little bit of reflection in the foreground is a nice added touch.</td>', 'Great title!!  I wish there were a bit more coloration in the sunset, but the sun flare is well achieved and not too "bright." The little bit of reflection in the foreground is a nice added touch.', '2005-09-21 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726665, 234010, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Beautiful and different color - you don''t see orange that often. I like the detail of the stems and the shadowing of the blossoms. Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Beautiful and different color - you don''t see orange that often. I like the detail of the stems and the shadowing of the blossoms. Nice use of negative space.', '2005-09-21 10:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726666, 234617, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is awsome! Creativity well executed, I think it''d work well as stock. I do kindof get the faint impression that hes going uphill so the table cloth might not be completly horizontal. I think it actually works here, but I don''t know if thats intentional for one, and two even if thats the case. My eyes just might be tired :)</td>', 'This is awsome! Creativity well executed, I think it''d work well as stock. I do kindof get the faint impression that hes going uphill so the table cloth might not be completly horizontal. I think it actually works here, but I don''t know if thats intentional for one, and two even if thats the case. My eyes just might be tired :)', '2005-09-21 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726667, 234632, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  I wish the background didn''t have any detail to it - I am guessing it''s wood.  The reflections are interesting. I think the grid isn''t exactly square as the vertical lines seem to be going off to the right ever so slightly.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  I wish the background didn''t have any detail to it - I am guessing it''s wood.  The reflections are interesting. I think the grid isn''t exactly square as the vertical lines seem to be going off to the right ever so slightly.', '2005-09-21 10:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726668, 233077, 3569, '<td valign="top">add a bit of contrast and you get more points next time</td>', 'add a bit of contrast and you get more points next time', '2005-09-21 10:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726670, 232835, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great title.  I love the vibrancy of the colors.  Great DOF and different. This is really a fun shot to look upon. I like the lighting hitting him from the back.  The movement of it is interesting and not overdone.</td>', 'Great title.  I love the vibrancy of the colors.  Great DOF and different. This is really a fun shot to look upon. I like the lighting hitting him from the back.  The movement of it is interesting and not overdone.', '2005-09-21 10:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726674, 232475, 15711, '<td valign="top">Those faces- hee hee. I love the bovine look. I wish this had a bit more interest.  I love the cows, but to me, it would have worked even better if only the top two on the left, or the bottom two on the right were in the shot.  Although it suits the challange, it has a busy snapshot sense with so many in the image.</td>', 'Those faces- hee hee. I love the bovine look. I wish this had a bit more interest.  I love the cows, but to me, it would have worked even better if only the top two on the left, or the bottom two on the right were in the shot.  Although it suits the challange, it has a busy snapshot sense with so many in the image.', '2005-09-21 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726677, 233068, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the intensity of color in the horses but the blue of the sky and the grass color seems a bit blah.  Maybe up the cyan and the green a bit. is this Kentucky??</td>', 'I like the intensity of color in the horses but the blue of the sky and the grass color seems a bit blah.  Maybe up the cyan and the green a bit. is this Kentucky??', '2005-09-21 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1726680, 232748, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - great title. I wish the light to the upper left were not so harsh. I like the vivid blue sky and the nice coloration of the balloon.</td>', 'HEE HEE - great title. I wish the light to the upper left were not so harsh. I like the vivid blue sky and the nice coloration of the balloon.', '2005-09-21 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726683, 234587, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I''m amazed that it is so clear.  I wish the colors were a tad more intense but it does suit the challenge.</td>', 'Great action shot. I''m amazed that it is so clear.  I wish the colors were a tad more intense but it does suit the challenge.', '2005-09-21 10:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726686, 232061, 37961, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh I really like this. Love the way you did the frameing seperately on the window, and the dark framing around that. Very clever. 10.</td>', 'Ooohhh I really like this. Love the way you did the frameing seperately on the window, and the dark framing around that. Very clever. 10.', '2005-09-21 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726688, 234500, 37961, '<td valign="top">Really love this. The rich orange tabby against the dry grass. The angle is excellent...very creative. 10</td>', 'Really love this. The rich orange tabby against the dry grass. The angle is excellent...very creative. 10', '2005-09-21 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726690, 234164, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the single figure against the sea setting. Maybe up the contrast a smidge.  The composition works but is a tad boring.  Hmmmm - maybe more contrast would help although that might not be available with the mid tones in this shot.</td>', 'I like the single figure against the sea setting. Maybe up the contrast a smidge.  The composition works but is a tad boring.  Hmmmm - maybe more contrast would help although that might not be available with the mid tones in this shot.', '2005-09-21 10:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726697, 234617, 37961, '<td valign="top">Crazy! Love it.</td>', 'Crazy! Love it.', '2005-09-21 10:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726699, 232814, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh what a great title.  This is very interesting. The use of negative space is great. I like the vivid colors of the kite as well.  The light (sun?) bothers me for some reason. I can''t put my finger on it quite exactly. Hmmmm - I''m going to think about it and come back.</td>', 'Oh what a great title.  This is very interesting. The use of negative space is great. I like the vivid colors of the kite as well.  The light (sun?) bothers me for some reason. I can''t put my finger on it quite exactly. Hmmmm - I''m going to think about it and come back.', '2005-09-21 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726703, 234405, 37961, '<td valign="top">I love rats. This is very well taken too. I guess he lives near the river. Amazing. 10.</td>', 'I love rats. This is very well taken too. I guess he lives near the river. Amazing. 10.', '2005-09-21 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726705, 232812, 15711, '<td valign="top">NOt a big fan of the dirty fingernail and peeling skin of the finger. The butterfly is pretty but could use a smidge more focus. The composition is ok, but overall, it kind of leaves me flat.</td>', 'NOt a big fan of the dirty fingernail and peeling skin of the finger. The butterfly is pretty but could use a smidge more focus. The composition is ok, but overall, it kind of leaves me flat.', '2005-09-21 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726707, 234536, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - perfect composition but the colors are a bit washed out and the focus could use a bit of work as well. This might be a good study in black and white with tack sharp focus - you''d really have something then.</td>', 'HEE HEE - perfect composition but the colors are a bit washed out and the focus could use a bit of work as well. This might be a good study in black and white with tack sharp focus - you''d really have something then.', '2005-09-21 10:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726710, 234084, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love it that tigers are the only big cat that enjoys swimming.  The movement of the water and coloration against the golden hues of his fur is a nice contrast. I like the reflection as well.  I wish his eyes a a touch of sparkle in them.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love it that tigers are the only big cat that enjoys swimming.  The movement of the water and coloration against the golden hues of his fur is a nice contrast. I like the reflection as well.  I wish his eyes a a touch of sparkle in them.', '2005-09-21 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726714, 233348, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. I like his far off gaze.  Good clarity and focus.  His placement in the shot is as if you picked him up and put him there.  This would work as a study in black and white too. I think there is enough contrast of tones to carry it off. Just a thought. Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely capture. I like his far off gaze.  Good clarity and focus.  His placement in the shot is as if you picked him up and put him there.  This would work as a study in black and white too. I think there is enough contrast of tones to carry it off. Just a thought. Nicely done.', '2005-09-21 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726720, 234640, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the title.  I sense a tad bit of focus problems . That''s disappointing because I love the black background and the light.  The colors are beautiful too. 7</td>', 'I love the title.  I sense a tad bit of focus problems . That''s disappointing because I love the black background and the light.  The colors are beautiful too. 7', '2005-09-21 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726722, 234311, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - clever title. I love his face.  The murky bottom isn''t very appealing, but HEH - it''s a frog.  In a perfect set up, he''d be on a lilly pad with sparkling water. ;~)</td>', 'HEE HEE - clever title. I love his face.  The murky bottom isn''t very appealing, but HEH - it''s a frog.  In a perfect set up, he''d be on a lilly pad with sparkling water. ;~)', '2005-09-21 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726726, 234596, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the rural sense of this.  The diminished colors really work well. You might up the contrast a hair.  Overall - very nice and suits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Love the rural sense of this.  The diminished colors really work well. You might up the contrast a hair.  Overall - very nice and suits the challenge perfectly.', '2005-09-21 10:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726749, 232501, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice attractive model with eye at the 1/3 intersection. Not sure if there is meaning behind the sign besides the fact that she is a girl.</td>', 'Nice attractive model with eye at the 1/3 intersection. Not sure if there is meaning behind the sign besides the fact that she is a girl.', '2005-09-21 10:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726755, 233937, 40484, '<td valign="top">a closer crop would have placed one of the swans more into the "thirds" intersection. Nice clarity and depth of field</td>', 'a closer crop would have placed one of the swans more into the "thirds" intersection. Nice clarity and depth of field', '2005-09-21 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726758, 232478, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds in a landscape. Sky is beautiful blue. Doesn''t use intersection of thirds to draw attention to anything.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds in a landscape. Sky is beautiful blue. Doesn''t use intersection of thirds to draw attention to anything.', '2005-09-21 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726762, 233090, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky and reflected in the water. Boat is right at intersection of thirds. Sun and the boat compete for attention since they are so close to each other.</td>', 'Nice colors in the sky and reflected in the water. Boat is right at intersection of thirds. Sun and the boat compete for attention since they are so close to each other.', '2005-09-21 11:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726768, 233002, 40484, '<td valign="top">IMHO a sharper focus may have improved this shot. I like that you used the shadow along the thirds line for the focal point of the shot</td>', 'IMHO a sharper focus may have improved this shot. I like that you used the shadow along the thirds line for the focal point of the shot', '2005-09-21 11:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726769, 232302, 40484, '<td valign="top">awsome capture</td>', 'awsome capture', '2005-09-21 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726771, 234445, 9111, '<td valign="top">This photogrpah is way too dark, and its difficult to see whats goign on in this photograph.<br/>I can see the side of a persons face and what appears to be a microphone? <br/></td>', 'This photogrpah is way too dark, and its difficult to see whats goign on in this photograph.I can see the side of a persons face and what appears to be a microphone? ', '2005-09-21 11:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726779, 234315, 39664, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  So vivid and clear!  Nice fit to the challenge.  I hope this finishes high as this a one of my favorites! 10+</td>', 'Excellent shot!  So vivid and clear!  Nice fit to the challenge.  I hope this finishes high as this a one of my favorites! 10+', '2005-09-21 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726781, 232389, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  With reflections you have to be careful of what you pick up that you didn''t want in the image - in this case it appears to be the roof line of a house?  The composition is also a bit tight.  The bottom left figurine''s reflection should all be included, the middle right figurine needs more space to the right, and the top left figurine needs more space to the left (and maybe more up top).  This particular piece of glass/mirror is compelling - try rigging it up with a solid white or solid black top cover (hang cloth or poster board over it), or try it on a nice blue sky, puffy white cloud kind of day.   Focus is a bit fuzzy nearing the top left figurine - for this type of shot a deep aperture is helpful.  The lighting and exposure look fine.<br/> <br/>Right idea - just a little more attention to details...  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice concept.  With reflections you have to be careful of what you pick up that you didn''t want in the image - in this case it appears to be the roof line of a house?  The composition is also a bit tight.  The bottom left figurine''s reflection should all be included, the middle right figurine needs more space to the right, and the top left figurine needs more space to the left (and maybe more up top).  This particular piece of glass/mirror is compelling - try rigging it up with a solid white or solid black top cover (hang cloth or poster board over it), or try it on a nice blue sky, puffy white cloud kind of day.   Focus is a bit fuzzy nearing the top left figurine - for this type of shot a deep aperture is helpful.  The lighting and exposure look fine. Right idea - just a little more attention to details...  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-21 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726799, 232568, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the flower. Stamens have interesting texture to them. Plenty of contrast in the image. Nice use of thirds focuses attention on the stamen. May try more diffused lighting to eliminate shadows on pedals.</td>', 'Nice color in the flower. Stamens have interesting texture to them. Plenty of contrast in the image. Nice use of thirds focuses attention on the stamen. May try more diffused lighting to eliminate shadows on pedals.', '2005-09-21 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726807, 233802, 44540, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the green color. Flower is set well off to the left third of frame. Lighting looks pleasing. Could lower flower a bit to bring it in to the intersection of thirds.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the green color. Flower is set well off to the left third of frame. Lighting looks pleasing. Could lower flower a bit to bring it in to the intersection of thirds.', '2005-09-21 11:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726817, 233926, 44540, '<td valign="top">Not a great use of rule of thirds. No subject stands out. Leaves are a little blurry. Pretty colors.</td>', 'Not a great use of rule of thirds. No subject stands out. Leaves are a little blurry. Pretty colors.', '2005-09-21 11:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726829, 232281, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour and light.</td>', 'Beautiful colour and light.', '2005-09-21 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726832, 234103, 44540, '<td valign="top">Well placed. Looks to be in the shade with not much variation in tone. Mostly midtones without definate highlights or shadows. Lots of stuff in the background a little distracting.</td>', 'Well placed. Looks to be in the shade with not much variation in tone. Mostly midtones without definate highlights or shadows. Lots of stuff in the background a little distracting.', '2005-09-21 11:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
