(1726842, 234661, 44540, '<td valign="top">Subject placed well at intersection of thirds. Good light on the subject, brings it out from the background. Sidelighting brings out interesting texture. Not sure what it is, but I like it.</td>', 'Subject placed well at intersection of thirds. Good light on the subject, brings it out from the background. Sidelighting brings out interesting texture. Not sure what it is, but I like it.', '2005-09-21 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
