(1726927, 233407, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  The horse''s coloring is very striking with the white face.  I''d like to see more contrast, but other than that, it''s a nice shot.  Maybe delete a tad of the foreground and it wouldn''t mess up your rule of thirds, and actually might enhance it from a horizontal perspective.</td>', 'I like this alot.  The horse''s coloring is very striking with the white face.  I''d like to see more contrast, but other than that, it''s a nice shot.  Maybe delete a tad of the foreground and it wouldn''t mess up your rule of thirds, and actually might enhance it from a horizontal perspective.', '2005-09-21 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726929, 234609, 44540, '<td valign="top">Wow, dreamy! The sky looks unreal! Great use of thirds here with the horizon at the third lower horizontal thirds line and the lighthouse at the left thirds line. Color really accentuates the lines well. Would have like to see something in the sky (bird, cloud, sun,  etc.) to let me know it was on our planet.</td>', 'Wow, dreamy! The sky looks unreal! Great use of thirds here with the horizon at the third lower horizontal thirds line and the lighthouse at the left thirds line. Color really accentuates the lines well. Would have like to see something in the sky (bird, cloud, sun,  etc.) to let me know it was on our planet.', '2005-09-21 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726930, 234616, 35741, '<td valign="top">A rule of thirds? Hmmm... Maybe... but I think the beautiful red sun is the point of this picture and therefore should be a bit another place. But I like this.</td>', 'A rule of thirds? Hmmm... Maybe... but I think the beautiful red sun is the point of this picture and therefore should be a bit another place. But I like this.', '2005-09-21 12:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
