(1726943, 234053, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors.  The holes in the leaf  to the right is a tad distracting with the busy aspect of it.  Love the bird''s detail and clarity. The harsh lighting reflection on the stem might use some work but is hard under basic editing. Good placement and the DOF is well executed.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors.  The holes in the leaf  to the right is a tad distracting with the busy aspect of it.  Love the bird''s detail and clarity. The harsh lighting reflection on the stem might use some work but is hard under basic editing. Good placement and the DOF is well executed.', '2005-09-21 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726947, 231893, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful baby.  His eyes are tack sharp.  The shirt with it''s design is a tad distracting - maybe throw a solid color blanket or have him wearing a solid color shirt.  But overall, it is an excellent portrait!!!</td>', 'What a beautiful baby.  His eyes are tack sharp.  The shirt with it''s design is a tad distracting - maybe throw a solid color blanket or have him wearing a solid color shirt.  But overall, it is an excellent portrait!!!', '2005-09-21 12:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
