(1726952, 233279, 35741, '<td valign="top">I think the position of a butterfly would have demanded a bit different composition. The pic would please my eye more if the butterfly would have located down right and there would have been space to its movement on the left. But I like the colours and an atmosphere of this photo.</td>', 'I think the position of a butterfly would have demanded a bit different composition. The pic would please my eye more if the butterfly would have located down right and there would have been space to its movement on the left. But I like the colours and an atmosphere of this photo.', '2005-09-21 12:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726955, 234156, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro. The blue and pink tones are a great compliment to each other. The luminoscity is lovely and the clarity of the center - spot on.  Great DOF and the use of negative space works real well for the rule of thirds!!!</td>', 'Wonderful macro. The blue and pink tones are a great compliment to each other. The luminoscity is lovely and the clarity of the center - spot on.  Great DOF and the use of negative space works real well for the rule of thirds!!!', '2005-09-21 12:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726958, 234301, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh funny.  Love the title.  How original.  The vivid green is great with the chair poking up out of the water.  I like this for it''s abstract funkiness.  8</td>', 'Oh funny.  Love the title.  How original.  The vivid green is great with the chair poking up out of the water.  I like this for it''s abstract funkiness.  8', '2005-09-21 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726960, 233977, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ah, good old Rooster Rock.</td>', 'Ah, good old Rooster Rock.', '2005-09-21 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726961, 234388, 15711, '<td valign="top">The touch of red makes the shot. Love the windmill!! I wish the sky color were a bit more vitrant.  The reflection in the marsh is pretty.  It might be fun to try a single color sat, by ridding the shot of all of the color except the red.  Just a fun thought. ;~D</td>', 'The touch of red makes the shot. Love the windmill!! I wish the sky color were a bit more vitrant.  The reflection in the marsh is pretty.  It might be fun to try a single color sat, by ridding the shot of all of the color except the red.  Just a fun thought. ;~D', '2005-09-21 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726965, 233241, 35741, '<td valign="top">There are no tones in up right and therefore I would have cropped a little from up. But a succesful composition and a pic.</td>', 'There are no tones in up right and therefore I would have cropped a little from up. But a succesful composition and a pic.', '2005-09-21 12:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726966, 231997, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  As I said in another comment with a field of cattle, I love the horses but with so many, it almost makes it too busy.  I''d love to just see two or 3 strategically placed in the shot, but I''m sure with the circumstances, that is impossible.  The lighting seems a touch overexposed. Maybe it''s just the glimmer on the palamino''s coat in the foreground.  It is a cute idea and the title is certainly suitable. ;~D This might be a fun study in black and white. I think there is enough contrast for that to work. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot.  As I said in another comment with a field of cattle, I love the horses but with so many, it almost makes it too busy.  I''d love to just see two or 3 strategically placed in the shot, but I''m sure with the circumstances, that is impossible.  The lighting seems a touch overexposed. Maybe it''s just the glimmer on the palamino''s coat in the foreground.  It is a cute idea and the title is certainly suitable. ;~D This might be a fun study in black and white. I think there is enough contrast for that to work. Good luck.', '2005-09-21 12:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726968, 234617, 12750, '<td valign="top">lol, I love this. I assume this is not real but great idea.  And if it is real than even more props to the capture! 9</td>', 'lol, I love this. I assume this is not real but great idea.  And if it is real than even more props to the capture! 9', '2005-09-21 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
