(1726978, 234603, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very striking and not the typical single stem poking up against a solid background.  The contrast is great. You might even could up it a bit more.  Also, you might try taking the single color selector and taking  all of the black out of the white.  Those flowers might really have some pizzaz then. I like the stamens being so visible and the bud in the lower part.  Very nice overall -- perfect use of black and white.</td>', 'Very striking and not the typical single stem poking up against a solid background.  The contrast is great. You might even could up it a bit more.  Also, you might try taking the single color selector and taking  all of the black out of the white.  Those flowers might really have some pizzaz then. I like the stamens being so visible and the bud in the lower part.  Very nice overall -- perfect use of black and white.', '2005-09-21 12:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
