(1726991, 234460, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great pic, I really like it, but I wonder what the focal point is and where/what the rule of thirds is being applied to?  I guess I''m not seeing a main subject other than the entire image.</td>', 'Great pic, I really like it, but I wonder what the focal point is and where/what the rule of thirds is being applied to?  I guess I''m not seeing a main subject other than the entire image.', '2005-09-21 12:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
