(1726995, 232227, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice stop of the action. Focus on the man''s head is nice and sharp. Interesting diagonal line created by surfer and the wave. Right now surfer''s shoulder is at intersection of thirds; would rather see his face there.</td>', 'Nice stop of the action. Focus on the man''s head is nice and sharp. Interesting diagonal line created by surfer and the wave. Right now surfer''s shoulder is at intersection of thirds; would rather see his face there.', '2005-09-21 12:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1726997, 233407, 12750, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea but there is so much grey/medium contrast here that most of the picture blends in together making it hard to outline objects.   Maybe play with the brightness/contrast settings to help this?</td>', 'This was a good idea but there is so much grey/medium contrast here that most of the picture blends in together making it hard to outline objects.   Maybe play with the brightness/contrast settings to help this?', '2005-09-21 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
