(1727003, 233279, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The bright lantana is a compliment to the butterfly and a nice contrast to the green of the leaves.  It does seem a bit out of focus though.  Not the deliberate area in the background, which is fine, but some of the area to the right.  The colors make it very appealing. With spot on focus, this could be a real winner.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The bright lantana is a compliment to the butterfly and a nice contrast to the green of the leaves.  It does seem a bit out of focus though.  Not the deliberate area in the background, which is fine, but some of the area to the right.  The colors make it very appealing. With spot on focus, this could be a real winner.', '2005-09-21 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
