(1727114, 232421, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  Cute!!  I sort of miss the green of the shrubbery, but I know what you were going for. Hmmm - it needs a touch of red somewhere.  Good composition and clarity.</td>', 'ROFL.  Cute!!  I sort of miss the green of the shrubbery, but I know what you were going for. Hmmm - it needs a touch of red somewhere.  Good composition and clarity.', '2005-09-21 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
