(1727158, 234147, 15711, '<td valign="top">This popped up on the screen and I immediatey smiled.  It could use a bit of curves adjustment to really up the colors.  Happy baby - he''s having fun.  I like that. The composition is well done. If he had on a red shirt, the contrast would really add some pinache to it.</td>', 'This popped up on the screen and I immediatey smiled.  It could use a bit of curves adjustment to really up the colors.  Happy baby - he''s having fun.  I like that. The composition is well done. If he had on a red shirt, the contrast would really add some pinache to it.', '2005-09-21 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727162, 234179, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT! Love that he''s peeking from the limb.  Beautiful skin tones.  great detail of the water on his face.  The light bouncing off of his mouth is nice.  The eyes are spot on clear and so intense. This may have my highest score!!! Really well composed and executed.</td>', 'GREAT SHOT! Love that he''s peeking from the limb.  Beautiful skin tones.  great detail of the water on his face.  The light bouncing off of his mouth is nice.  The eyes are spot on clear and so intense. This may have my highest score!!! Really well composed and executed.', '2005-09-21 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727163, 234189, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of subject in the line of thirds on the right of the frame. Head/body are about at the intersection of the upper/right lines. Not sure what the man is doing, interesting image though.</td>', 'Nice placement of subject in the line of thirds on the right of the frame. Head/body are about at the intersection of the upper/right lines. Not sure what the man is doing, interesting image though.', '2005-09-21 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727165, 233281, 43565, '<td valign="top">Too mcuh glare on the water and the bird should be more in focus.</td>', 'Too mcuh glare on the water and the bird should be more in focus.', '2005-09-21 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727166, 234290, 43156, '<td valign="top">I think a little too close to the center for this challenge, nice picture though.</td>', 'I think a little too close to the center for this challenge, nice picture though.', '2005-09-21 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727170, 234637, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of lizard in the frame. Light/shadow transition is nice and nearly follows the thirds rule. Would like to see head more at the intersection of the thirds though.</td>', 'Nice placement of lizard in the frame. Light/shadow transition is nice and nearly follows the thirds rule. Would like to see head more at the intersection of the thirds though.', '2005-09-21 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727174, 232861, 44540, '<td valign="top">I see the thirds. Not quite sharp and not much visual interest.</td>', 'I see the thirds. Not quite sharp and not much visual interest.', '2005-09-21 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727181, 232813, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is not interesting to me. I also don''t like the lighting.</td>', 'This is not interesting to me. I also don''t like the lighting.', '2005-09-21 13:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727184, 234388, 24951, '<td valign="top">I personally would have liked to have seen this a little brighter, but I''m still giving it a 10.</td>', 'I personally would have liked to have seen this a little brighter, but I''m still giving it a 10.', '2005-09-21 13:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727185, 232657, 44540, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Nice placement of the boy''s head at the intersection of thirds. Grouping of the parents sets the boy off also which is nice and adds to the drama of the situation. Title adds a lot to the context. Great candid photo!</td>', 'Very funny. Nice placement of the boy''s head at the intersection of thirds. Grouping of the parents sets the boy off also which is nice and adds to the drama of the situation. Title adds a lot to the context. Great candid photo!', '2005-09-21 13:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727189, 234445, 24951, '<td valign="top">Way too dark</td>', 'Way too dark', '2005-09-21 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727190, 234609, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely sea scape.  The red of the lighthouse building makes the shot for me. Great color contrast works, even without it being too bright. Nicely composed.  Very pretty indeed.</td>', 'Lovely sea scape.  The red of the lighthouse building makes the shot for me. Great color contrast works, even without it being too bright. Nicely composed.  Very pretty indeed.', '2005-09-21 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727194, 234194, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this idea (would have also worked good in Perspective).  I would like the playground equipment to have less glare, and I think you missed the horizontal thirds line.</td>', 'I like this idea (would have also worked good in Perspective).  I would like the playground equipment to have less glare, and I think you missed the horizontal thirds line.', '2005-09-21 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727196, 234485, 24913, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus was sharper....</td>', 'Wish the focus was sharper....', '2005-09-21 13:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727197, 234278, 43565, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t interest me I don''t think this really meets the rule of thirds.</td>', 'This really doesn''t interest me I don''t think this really meets the rule of thirds.', '2005-09-21 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727203, 232645, 24951, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, but would it not have been more in tune with the challenge if the vase/flowers were a little more to the right?</td>', 'This is wonderful, but would it not have been more in tune with the challenge if the vase/flowers were a little more to the right?', '2005-09-21 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727205, 232141, 23107, '<td valign="top">This is like your standard hotel hallway, but you''ve made it a mysterious looking place by taking it at night.  Even the blurred people add something to this.  I wonder how it would look if you had more blurred people interspersed throughout the frame.  Leading lnes into the bottom right intersection, excellent!</td>', 'This is like your standard hotel hallway, but you''ve made it a mysterious looking place by taking it at night.  Even the blurred people add something to this.  I wonder how it would look if you had more blurred people interspersed throughout the frame.  Leading lnes into the bottom right intersection, excellent!', '2005-09-21 13:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727208, 232387, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this meets the rule of thirds, and it is not interesting to me--maybe if they were in more interesting poses.</td>', 'I don''t think this meets the rule of thirds, and it is not interesting to me--maybe if they were in more interesting poses.', '2005-09-21 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727214, 233933, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with the clouds more in focus, and I could see the silhouette of the land better.</td>', 'I would like this better with the clouds more in focus, and I could see the silhouette of the land better.', '2005-09-21 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727231, 232389, 23107, '<td valign="top">I look at this and I wonder what is going on.  The elements seem to have nothing to do with each other and it confuses me as to what my focus should be.  Even though there are leading lines to the lower right intersection, the contrast of the elements draws me elsewhere but pulls me back giving it a tension I do not think belongs here.    The statuettes also seem to be out of focus for some reason.</td>', 'I look at this and I wonder what is going on.  The elements seem to have nothing to do with each other and it confuses me as to what my focus should be.  Even though there are leading lines to the lower right intersection, the contrast of the elements draws me elsewhere but pulls me back giving it a tension I do not think belongs here.    The statuettes also seem to be out of focus for some reason.', '2005-09-21 13:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727236, 234424, 43565, '<td valign="top">Definitely rule of thirds, but not very interesting to me. ( I also think your border is too thick.)</td>', 'Definitely rule of thirds, but not very interesting to me. ( I also think your border is too thick.)', '2005-09-21 13:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727239, 234125, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think there was too much light.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think there was too much light.', '2005-09-21 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727247, 233945, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great idea and shot, but seems a little over-processed in areas. A little too much noise in the neutral tones also. Neat Image might have corrected this. If you intended to have the photo look like this - Sorry, but I don''t think it works, but it has great potential - you''ve got the right idea IMO.</td>', 'Great idea and shot, but seems a little over-processed in areas. A little too much noise in the neutral tones also. Neat Image might have corrected this. If you intended to have the photo look like this - Sorry, but I don''t think it works, but it has great potential - you''ve got the right idea IMO.', '2005-09-21 13:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727249, 234445, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks more centered than rules of thirds.  It is also too dark for me.</td>', 'This looks more centered than rules of thirds.  It is also too dark for me.', '2005-09-21 13:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727256, 233353, 24951, '<td valign="top">A little noisy especially the blue.</td>', 'A little noisy especially the blue.', '2005-09-21 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727261, 231489, 43156, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, just a bit out of focus</td>', 'Nice shot, just a bit out of focus', '2005-09-21 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727282, 234605, 24951, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have trimmed the topright corner a bit.</td>', 'Maybe would have trimmed the topright corner a bit.', '2005-09-21 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727297, 234539, 24913, '<td valign="top">A little too close to the sidefor my liking...</td>', 'A little too close to the sidefor my liking...', '2005-09-21 13:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727310, 233348, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great pose, great look on face.10</td>', 'Great pose, great look on face.10', '2005-09-21 13:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727312, 232920, 14212, '<td valign="top">Almost gave you a 10 but the leaf isn''t defined enough so 9. Finally an inspiring thirds shot!</td>', 'Almost gave you a 10 but the leaf isn''t defined enough so 9. Finally an inspiring thirds shot!', '2005-09-21 13:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727317, 234186, 40703, '<td valign="top">Whoa. I like it. How was this shot taken?</td>', 'Whoa. I like it. How was this shot taken?', '2005-09-21 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727329, 232965, 40703, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The tree is a nice touch. I''m guessing some might disagree, but I think this is a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful. The tree is a nice touch. I''m guessing some might disagree, but I think this is a beautiful shot.', '2005-09-21 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727331, 233348, 14212, '<td valign="top">And heeere''s the winner! 10</td>', 'And heeere''s the winner! 10', '2005-09-21 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727338, 232816, 38592, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture with great tones.  Definitely my top pick and pretty sure this will take a ribbon.  Good job.</td>', 'Amazing picture with great tones.  Definitely my top pick and pretty sure this will take a ribbon.  Good job.', '2005-09-21 13:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727346, 234134, 14212, '<td valign="top">You should be "in place" with this one. 8</td>', 'You should be "in place" with this one. 8', '2005-09-21 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727347, 232816, 44540, '<td valign="top">This is one amazing photo. Sharpness is superb and the texture of the surface of the water as well as the bird are superb. Bird is placed along right third of frame. Reflection is complete and makes for an impressive overall image. Intersection of thirds lines, however are at the back of the bird''s body. This shot is everything but perfect.</td>', 'This is one amazing photo. Sharpness is superb and the texture of the surface of the water as well as the bird are superb. Bird is placed along right third of frame. Reflection is complete and makes for an impressive overall image. Intersection of thirds lines, however are at the back of the bird''s body. This shot is everything but perfect.', '2005-09-21 13:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727352, 234311, 44540, '<td valign="top">Frog''s eye in intersection of thirds lines. Nicely done. Some foliage out of focus in the forground is a little distracting.</td>', 'Frog''s eye in intersection of thirds lines. Nicely done. Some foliage out of focus in the forground is a little distracting.', '2005-09-21 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727364, 232289, 44540, '<td valign="top">Shoreline is about at upper third line, though not horizontally straight, seems to creep up to the right. Bright blue light is not quite along the 1/3 line on the right side. No real focal point.</td>', 'Shoreline is about at upper third line, though not horizontally straight, seems to creep up to the right. Bright blue light is not quite along the 1/3 line on the right side. No real focal point.', '2005-09-21 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727366, 234445, 38592, '<td valign="top">Way too dark... can barley see any detail</td>', 'Way too dark... can barley see any detail', '2005-09-21 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727367, 232280, 38592, '<td valign="top">Looks like the main focus of this image (the bird) is dead center.  Try using the thirds a bit more</td>', 'Looks like the main focus of this image (the bird) is dead center.  Try using the thirds a bit more', '2005-09-21 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727372, 233047, 44540, '<td valign="top">This kid is great. Great expression! The placement alone the left 1/3 line is very nice. Light on the face seems to be about 45 front lighting and creates some nice shadows. Only thing is he had to squint.</td>', 'This kid is great. Great expression! The placement alone the left 1/3 line is very nice. Light on the face seems to be about 45 front lighting and creates some nice shadows. Only thing is he had to squint.', '2005-09-21 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727381, 233309, 40703, '<td valign="top">Ooo...kind of a Tim Burton design there with all the curls.</td>', 'Ooo...kind of a Tim Burton design there with all the curls.', '2005-09-21 13:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727383, 232341, 44540, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the use of thirds too much here. Sort of with the face on the upper left side but your eye is not drawn to anything specific. Front light is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Not seeing the use of thirds too much here. Sort of with the face on the upper left side but your eye is not drawn to anything specific. Front light is a bit harsh.', '2005-09-21 13:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727388, 234147, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of subject in the right of frame; gives him somewhere to walk in to. Face might be a tad to the right of the 1/3 line. Color temp is a little cool due to the shade.</td>', 'Nice placement of subject in the right of frame; gives him somewhere to walk in to. Face might be a tad to the right of the 1/3 line. Color temp is a little cool due to the shade.', '2005-09-21 13:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727392, 234646, 40703, '<td valign="top">I feel small...heehee...</td>', 'I feel small...heehee...', '2005-09-21 13:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727397, 233977, 44540, '<td valign="top">Cool scenic. Placement is along the right 1/3 line, though maybe a bit to the right. Plateau creates another 1/3 line along the upper horizontal. Impressive building is just about at the intersection, almost.</td>', 'Cool scenic. Placement is along the right 1/3 line, though maybe a bit to the right. Plateau creates another 1/3 line along the upper horizontal. Impressive building is just about at the intersection, almost.', '2005-09-21 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727406, 232861, 38592, '<td valign="top">Image is much too small and does not really meet the challenge.  You''re main focal point should fall under one of the intersecting point here they are all over the entire image.</td>', 'Image is much too small and does not really meet the challenge.  You''re main focal point should fall under one of the intersecting point here they are all over the entire image.', '2005-09-21 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727412, 233921, 38592, '<td valign="top">Green saturation may be a bit too high as it is leaving artifacts on the baseball.</td>', 'Green saturation may be a bit too high as it is leaving artifacts on the baseball.', '2005-09-21 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727418, 233763, 4281, '<td valign="top">Such a nice photograph but I find it to be slightly weakened because of the low-contrast B&amp;W effect. <br/>Other than that it does seem to be slightly soft, especially when looking at the cliff and some portions of the cliff and the riverbank seem to be overexposed.<br/>But I quite like the composition.<br/> <br/>I took the liberty to do a quick edit in Photoshop:<br/>//www.andri.org/temp/dpc-skogur-fikt.jpg<br/>(Let me know if you want the image removed.)</td>', 'Such a nice photograph but I find it to be slightly weakened because of the low-contrast B&W effect. Other than that it does seem to be slightly soft, especially when looking at the cliff and some portions of the cliff and the riverbank seem to be overexposed.But I quite like the composition. I took the liberty to do a quick edit in Photoshop://www.andri.org/temp/dpc-skogur-fikt.jpg(Let me know if you want the image removed.)', '2005-09-21 14:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727421, 232302, 38592, '<td valign="top">Wow... great stop action capture here.  The way the bird is looking directly at you really adds that extra punch to this picture.  One of my top picks of the challenge.</td>', 'Wow... great stop action capture here.  The way the bird is looking directly at you really adds that extra punch to this picture.  One of my top picks of the challenge.', '2005-09-21 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727425, 233781, 44540, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing color, calm and relaxing. The texture of the water is impressive. One subject is perfectly placed at the lower left. Not sure about the relationship of the two or what they are doing.</td>', 'Very pleasing color, calm and relaxing. The texture of the water is impressive. One subject is perfectly placed at the lower left. Not sure about the relationship of the two or what they are doing.', '2005-09-21 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727449, 234095, 44540, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white, great contrast and tonal range, highlights to shadows. Placement of the boat is a bit low and to the left of the 1/3 intersection. Clouds seem to have some blur to them while water and trees are sharp.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white, great contrast and tonal range, highlights to shadows. Placement of the boat is a bit low and to the left of the 1/3 intersection. Clouds seem to have some blur to them while water and trees are sharp.', '2005-09-21 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727454, 232995, 44540, '<td valign="top">The nose of the rider is smack on the 1/3 line. Very nice effect with the pan. Sense of motion/speed is excellent. Would like to see focal point at intersection of 1/3 lines. Though this would be very difficult to frame in this case.</td>', 'The nose of the rider is smack on the 1/3 line. Very nice effect with the pan. Sense of motion/speed is excellent. Would like to see focal point at intersection of 1/3 lines. Though this would be very difficult to frame in this case.', '2005-09-21 14:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727455, 234507, 43271, '<td valign="top">What a crapy photo, needs to be edited more. LOL jk its alright i will give it a 10</td>', 'What a crapy photo, needs to be edited more. LOL jk its alright i will give it a 10', '2005-09-21 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1727466, 233801, 44540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo! Thirds rule is repeated by the circular rings in the lower one third. Monkey is perfectly placed; his expression, very monkey like! Depth of field is good, although the multi-colored squares hanging in the background distract a little bit. Otherwise perfect in my book!</td>', 'Fantastic photo! Thirds rule is repeated by the circular rings in the lower one third. Monkey is perfectly placed; his expression, very monkey like! Depth of field is good, although the multi-colored squares hanging in the background distract a little bit. Otherwise perfect in my book!', '2005-09-21 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727474, 234443, 44540, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title, the subject would be unclear. Perhaps showing something through the blinds rather than the blinds themselves. Subject is not at intersection of 1/3 lines.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title, the subject would be unclear. Perhaps showing something through the blinds rather than the blinds themselves. Subject is not at intersection of 1/3 lines.', '2005-09-21 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727476, 234590, 42957, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! I''m adding this to favorites</td>', 'Nice colors! I''m adding this to favorites', '2005-09-21 14:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727492, 232465, 42181, '<td valign="top">Background a little busy, good picture though</td>', 'Background a little busy, good picture though', '2005-09-21 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727499, 234536, 42181, '<td valign="top">I like the simplisity of this picture</td>', 'I like the simplisity of this picture', '2005-09-21 14:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727501, 234191, 24913, '<td valign="top">out of focus... too bad, nice shot</td>', 'out of focus... too bad, nice shot', '2005-09-21 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727505, 232837, 21362, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Beautiful colors. I like how the shape of the spash follows the curve of his arm, like a natural backdrop or frame.</td>', 'Nice photo. Beautiful colors. I like how the shape of the spash follows the curve of his arm, like a natural backdrop or frame.', '2005-09-21 14:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727511, 232501, 42181, '<td valign="top">I know it''s the title but this picture could do without the sign, however that said. 8</td>', 'I know it''s the title but this picture could do without the sign, however that said. 8', '2005-09-21 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727513, 233775, 21362, '<td valign="top">I would''ve gotten in closer to the subject, maybe included more of that tree on the left, and less of the foreground and those shadows that draw the eye away. And picked up that piece of litter.</td>', 'I would''ve gotten in closer to the subject, maybe included more of that tree on the left, and less of the foreground and those shadows that draw the eye away. And picked up that piece of litter.', '2005-09-21 14:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727514, 234392, 21362, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and pretty range of blues and aquas between the water and the sky. The horizon looks a little wonky though.</td>', 'Nice subject and pretty range of blues and aquas between the water and the sky. The horizon looks a little wonky though.', '2005-09-21 14:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727519, 234541, 21362, '<td valign="top">Very flat lighting. Maybe with light cast on this, some extra dimension would add visual interest to the shapes and lines.</td>', 'Very flat lighting. Maybe with light cast on this, some extra dimension would add visual interest to the shapes and lines.', '2005-09-21 14:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727531, 234454, 43115, '<td valign="top">This picture is absolutley amazing.<br/>1) Incredibly creative take on the challenge<br/>2) Excellent technical execution<br/>3) Hauntingly spooky facial expression (perfect!)<br/>4) Creative title<br/> <br/>My only critique is that the light seems a bit harsh, especially around the 13mm point on the ruler and glare on the pencil.  Perhaps a diffuser on the light source would have balanced that out a little bit... unless your goal was to draw the eye to the 1/3rds point that is there... in which case incredibly well done!</td>', 'This picture is absolutley amazing.1) Incredibly creative take on the challenge2) Excellent technical execution3) Hauntingly spooky facial expression (perfect!)4) Creative title My only critique is that the light seems a bit harsh, especially around the 13mm point on the ruler and glare on the pencil.  Perhaps a diffuser on the light source would have balanced that out a little bit... unless your goal was to draw the eye to the 1/3rds point that is there... in which case incredibly well done!', '2005-09-21 14:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727532, 232840, 21362, '<td valign="top">The way the birds head and neck are in shadow really decrease its interest as a subject. The photo also seems a little overexposed.</td>', 'The way the birds head and neck are in shadow really decrease its interest as a subject. The photo also seems a little overexposed.', '2005-09-21 14:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727533, 233114, 21362, '<td valign="top">crooked horizon</td>', 'crooked horizon', '2005-09-21 14:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727552, 234363, 21362, '<td valign="top">To me it''s really the surfer himself that is the subject, and with that in mind he looks too centered to be following the rule of thirds. I think the placement would have had a bit more impact if it was zoomed out a bit and the subject was in the lower right, facing into the frame instead. As he is here, the line of the surfboard leads your eyes right out of the frame.</td>', 'To me it''s really the surfer himself that is the subject, and with that in mind he looks too centered to be following the rule of thirds. I think the placement would have had a bit more impact if it was zoomed out a bit and the subject was in the lower right, facing into the frame instead. As he is here, the line of the surfboard leads your eyes right out of the frame.', '2005-09-21 14:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727572, 234340, 19116, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice, peaceful image.  Good colors and sharpness.  I feel like it is missing a focal point- something that draws your attention.  Maybe a person walking away from the camera in the distance...  Good job though.</td>', 'This is a really nice, peaceful image.  Good colors and sharpness.  I feel like it is missing a focal point- something that draws your attention.  Maybe a person walking away from the camera in the distance...  Good job though.', '2005-09-21 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727606, 233324, 43774, '<td valign="top">I find the large rounded object distracting, it is a lot of empty space that doesn''t add to the photo.</td>', 'I find the large rounded object distracting, it is a lot of empty space that doesn''t add to the photo.', '2005-09-21 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727608, 234368, 43774, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of spots in the sky, seems to me your camera needs cleaning. I''m also not sure if this fits the rule of thirds theme.</td>', 'I see a lot of spots in the sky, seems to me your camera needs cleaning. I''m also not sure if this fits the rule of thirds theme.', '2005-09-21 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727611, 233256, 43774, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo but considering the flower almost completely fills the frame I don''t think it fits the rule of thirds theme.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo but considering the flower almost completely fills the frame I don''t think it fits the rule of thirds theme.', '2005-09-21 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727616, 234564, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme, but technically the photo needs work. The background is grainy (maybe over sharpened?) and the white on the bird looks overexposed.</td>', 'Fits the theme, but technically the photo needs work. The background is grainy (maybe over sharpened?) and the white on the bird looks overexposed.', '2005-09-21 15:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
