(1727777, 234274, 15711, '<td valign="top">bless her heart.  I have to up the score just for the cute factor.  What an adorable little old lady.  She seems to be enjoying her ride!!  I like the DOF. If it weren''t rule of thirds, I''d say crop the left and zoom on her.  She has a wonderful face.  The lighting is a little diminished, but I''m glad to see something different than flowers and birds!!</td>', 'bless her heart.  I have to up the score just for the cute factor.  What an adorable little old lady.  She seems to be enjoying her ride!!  I like the DOF. If it weren''t rule of thirds, I''d say crop the left and zoom on her.  She has a wonderful face.  The lighting is a little diminished, but I''m glad to see something different than flowers and birds!!', '2005-09-21 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727784, 234617, 15711, '<td valign="top">VERY CLEVER!!!  I like the picnic table idea but it''s almost a distraction with the checked tablecloth, the bright blue and the beige to the upper left (basket maybe?).  The title is awesome.</td>', 'VERY CLEVER!!!  I like the picnic table idea but it''s almost a distraction with the checked tablecloth, the bright blue and the beige to the upper left (basket maybe?).  The title is awesome.', '2005-09-21 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727789, 234644, 15711, '<td valign="top">the white on white on white works well and bring out her skin tones. I think I''d crop out most of the pink print and it''d still work for the rule of thirds. I might brighten up the background a bit too so it''s really white. Darling little girl with a sweet smile!</td>', 'the white on white on white works well and bring out her skin tones. I think I''d crop out most of the pink print and it''d still work for the rule of thirds. I might brighten up the background a bit too so it''s really white. Darling little girl with a sweet smile!', '2005-09-21 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
