(1727834, 234058, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow, I guess they do!!!! Not wild about the overall interest of the shot, but it is different to see a turkey on a tree limb!!!! The busy aspect of all of the branches detracts from the bird since there is not color other than the sky, to peak your eye''s interest.</td>', 'Wow, I guess they do!!!! Not wild about the overall interest of the shot, but it is different to see a turkey on a tree limb!!!! The busy aspect of all of the branches detracts from the bird since there is not color other than the sky, to peak your eye''s interest.', '2005-09-21 16:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
