(1728891, 234621, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=2<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Wonderful image.  Little bothered by the red thing by the fountain (a flower?)  Maybe your depth of field could have been a little better to blur the background and surrounding people a little more.  I think you did a good job on the velvet water.  Outside of the challenge I would probably work on cloning out the flower and blurring the people.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=0Wow factor/uniqueness=2Attractiveness=1 Wonderful image.  Little bothered by the red thing by the fountain (a flower?)  Maybe your depth of field could have been a little better to blur the background and surrounding people a little more.  I think you did a good job on the velvet water.  Outside of the challenge I would probably work on cloning out the flower and blurring the people. Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
