(1728972, 232426, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>Having a hard time determining the main subject but I''d have to guess it is the street and sidewalk.  If so, maybe moving past the tree or maybe back more would help make this more apparent.  Your sidewalk does start in the middle but nicely move to the left 3rd, helping your eyes move around the image.  Contrast seems a little dull too, probably just a slight adjustment would fix it.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0 Having a hard time determining the main subject but I''d have to guess it is the street and sidewalk.  If so, maybe moving past the tree or maybe back more would help make this more apparent.  Your sidewalk does start in the middle but nicely move to the left 3rd, helping your eyes move around the image.  Contrast seems a little dull too, probably just a slight adjustment would fix it. Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
