(1728990, 234364, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=2<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>I like this image a lot.  The boats rigging really adds a lot to the image, of course a better sunrise (or sunset) would be preferred but still very nice.  Is that a star above the boom in the upper right quadrant?  Can''t stop looking around the image.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=2Attractiveness=1 I like this image a lot.  The boats rigging really adds a lot to the image, of course a better sunrise (or sunset) would be preferred but still very nice.  Is that a star above the boom in the upper right quadrant?  Can''t stop looking around the image. Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
