(1729003, 234460, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=2<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>WOW! Very nice colors and placement.  The left to right slope of this really helps keep it from being boring.  Very sharp and you didn''t even blow out the crome.  Good job.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=2Attractiveness=1 WOW! Very nice colors and placement.  The left to right slope of this really helps keep it from being boring.  Very sharp and you didn''t even blow out the crome.  Good job. Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729006, 232301, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good potential, nice colors.  Criticism; while it seems you have met the Challenge with the ''rule'' (but I am not ''expert''), I would like to see a more precise ''placement'' using the rule.  Also, the focal point needs to be ''higher'', as the ''bottom'' of the bee, and the flower under it and left have the focus.  This does not look ''natural'' to me, (if it is my apologies), but the bee looks dead, and placed - if so, then a better ''positioning'' and angle would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  The soft lighting coupled with the ''yellows'' and ''creams'' is nice, but the darkness underneath detracts in my opinion to the ''feel'' of this shot.  Mainly the focal point(s) for me need addressing here, and that ''dark gap''.  Up to 5 from 4 for potential.</td>', '5 - Good potential, nice colors.  Criticism; while it seems you have met the Challenge with the ''rule'' (but I am not ''expert''), I would like to see a more precise ''placement'' using the rule.  Also, the focal point needs to be ''higher'', as the ''bottom'' of the bee, and the flower under it and left have the focus.  This does not look ''natural'' to me, (if it is my apologies), but the bee looks dead, and placed - if so, then a better ''positioning'' and angle would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  The soft lighting coupled with the ''yellows'' and ''creams'' is nice, but the darkness underneath detracts in my opinion to the ''feel'' of this shot.  Mainly the focal point(s) for me need addressing here, and that ''dark gap''.  Up to 5 from 4 for potential.', '2005-09-21 22:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729011, 234363, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great capture! ;)</td>', 'Great capture! ;)', '2005-09-21 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729018, 232643, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=2<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Another very unique and pleasant image.  It is so simple yet it screams for attention.  I kind of wish the red lifesaver wasn''t on the boat, it would help bring more attention to the red float in the water.  I really like the still water with the breeze creeping up behind the boat and the slight reflection<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=2Attractiveness=1 Another very unique and pleasant image.  It is so simple yet it screams for attention.  I kind of wish the red lifesaver wasn''t on the boat, it would help bring more attention to the red float in the water.  I really like the still water with the breeze creeping up behind the boat and the slight reflection Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729027, 234541, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>A unique array of lines and shapes but feels like it is missing something that makes it stand out.  Colors in the sky seem dull.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0DOF/focus=0Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0 A unique array of lines and shapes but feels like it is missing something that makes it stand out.  Colors in the sky seem dull.Good luck', '2005-09-21 22:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729031, 234447, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Interesting/unusual view.  Never seen down a bird''s throat before.  Criticism; based on your title and the subject, I''m guessing the bird/character was to be the main focus here.  In this Challenge, for me anyway, looking to the ''rule'', the thing I see ''primarily'' is what I commented on - down the throat.  While interesting, unless this was your intent, I think it needs a different crop or focus to ''deliver'' what you were setting out to do.  The detail in the nose and feathers around it is good, but I would like to have seen the tip of the beak in focus as well.  This has potential, especially with the colors (though the dark background I am not sure on), but I think you need to either ''zoom out'', or different angle.</td>', '5 - Interesting/unusual view.  Never seen down a bird''s throat before.  Criticism; based on your title and the subject, I''m guessing the bird/character was to be the main focus here.  In this Challenge, for me anyway, looking to the ''rule'', the thing I see ''primarily'' is what I commented on - down the throat.  While interesting, unless this was your intent, I think it needs a different crop or focus to ''deliver'' what you were setting out to do.  The detail in the nose and feathers around it is good, but I would like to have seen the tip of the beak in focus as well.  This has potential, especially with the colors (though the dark background I am not sure on), but I think you need to either ''zoom out'', or different angle.', '2005-09-21 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729034, 234075, 44540, '<td valign="top">I really like the placement of the person. The detail in the shadows is good, particularly the row that leads up to the person. Image is very sharp and follows rule of thirds well.</td>', 'I really like the placement of the person. The detail in the shadows is good, particularly the row that leads up to the person. Image is very sharp and follows rule of thirds well.', '2005-09-21 22:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
