(1729068, 232669, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>I like the variety of color and your depth of field at first seems good but the main subject seems a little too soft.  Maybe your depth of field was a little much since the orange cup seems sharp but the brush handle isn''t.  Good positioning and nice suttle frame.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=0Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0 I like the variety of color and your depth of field at first seems good but the main subject seems a little too soft.  Maybe your depth of field was a little much since the orange cup seems sharp but the brush handle isn''t.  Good positioning and nice suttle frame. Good luck', '2005-09-21 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729071, 233068, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=4<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=0<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0<br/>Attractiveness=0<br/> <br/>I''m going to have to assume that since the horses are mainly in the horizontal center of the image that you were probably going with the house being the subject(?)  If not I think more focus should be placed on the horses and their positioning better.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=4Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=0Wow factor/uniqueness=0Attractiveness=0 I''m going to have to assume that since the horses are mainly in the horizontal center of the image that you were probably going with the house being the subject(?)  If not I think more focus should be placed on the horses and their positioning better. Good luck', '2005-09-21 23:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
