(1729628, 234527, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not sure, perhaps a tighter crop on the left hand side, the wall is a touch detracting/distracting.  The water capture is excellent, from the top ''flow'' to the bottom ''mist''.  Technically, while no ''expert'', I think you have used the rule(s) well.  Maybe just a touch darker, creating more ''impact'', not sure.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Criticism; not sure, perhaps a tighter crop on the left hand side, the wall is a touch detracting/distracting.  The water capture is excellent, from the top ''flow'' to the bottom ''mist''.  Technically, while no ''expert'', I think you have used the rule(s) well.  Maybe just a touch darker, creating more ''impact'', not sure.', '2005-09-22 01:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
