(1729630, 232280, 40484, '<td valign="top">nice colors. am not sure if the bird of the orange is the focal point though. perhaps a slight bit more cropped off the top would have placed the bird''s eye at the thirds crossing point to bring focus there, IMHO</td>', 'nice colors. am not sure if the bird of the orange is the focal point though. perhaps a slight bit more cropped off the top would have placed the bird''s eye at the thirds crossing point to bring focus there, IMHO', '2005-09-22 01:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729633, 234626, 23107, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get what I am supposed to be focusing on or how the elements relate to each other.</td>', 'I just don''t get what I am supposed to be focusing on or how the elements relate to each other.', '2005-09-22 01:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729634, 234320, 31720, '<td valign="top">Blue bird against a blue sky?  I think another time of day would provide better lighting.</td>', 'Blue bird against a blue sky?  I think another time of day would provide better lighting.', '2005-09-22 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729635, 234532, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve matched the backgrond colour to the web page.</td>', 'I like how you''ve matched the backgrond colour to the web page.', '2005-09-22 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729637, 232806, 28882, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know if there are exceptions to the rule of thirds, but (I''m assuming the head is the primary subject here) the majority of the "content" is in a different third.  I guess that''s ok.  we''ll call it the "rule of birds" ;-)</td>', 'I really don''t know if there are exceptions to the rule of thirds, but (I''m assuming the head is the primary subject here) the majority of the "content" is in a different third.  I guess that''s ok.  we''ll call it the "rule of birds" ;-)', '2005-09-22 01:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729638, 234651, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great how you kept his face still</td>', 'Great how you kept his face still', '2005-09-22 01:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729641, 232357, 28882, '<td valign="top">like the shallow dof, and composure, just don''t see anything interesting here.</td>', 'like the shallow dof, and composure, just don''t see anything interesting here.', '2005-09-22 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729642, 232478, 23107, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2005-09-22 01:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729644, 234575, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Though not normally a fan of ''taking color from flowers'', with the texture and detail of the hibiscus - I think this works very well.  Criticism; I would like to have seen the end stamens(?) in focus, and that one middle left, not ''blown'', but difficult.  Title works well, frame also works too here I think.  How you have ''converted'' the texture on the petals, and indeed the ''glow like'' of the stamens, is what I like most about this shot.  Technically, while no ''expert'', I think the rule(s) are used well here and definitely enhance the shot/style.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Though not normally a fan of ''taking color from flowers'', with the texture and detail of the hibiscus - I think this works very well.  Criticism; I would like to have seen the end stamens(?) in focus, and that one middle left, not ''blown'', but difficult.  Title works well, frame also works too here I think.  How you have ''converted'' the texture on the petals, and indeed the ''glow like'' of the stamens, is what I like most about this shot.  Technically, while no ''expert'', I think the rule(s) are used well here and definitely enhance the shot/style.', '2005-09-22 01:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729645, 233763, 28882, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this image.</td>', 'I like the feel of this image.', '2005-09-22 01:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729651, 232655, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good, ''cute'', nice colors and amusing.  Criticism; more definition.  More contrast, sharper focus.. just noticed the background, looks oversharpened(?), so maybe a tighter crop, removing the background if possible, while retaining the rule(s), which I think you have used well here.  Perhaps a slight nudge rotation down on the right, not sure.  Also not sure on the frame, but I do not think it ''detracts''.  Good opportunity/timing.</td>', '8 - Good, ''cute'', nice colors and amusing.  Criticism; more definition.  More contrast, sharper focus.. just noticed the background, looks oversharpened(?), so maybe a tighter crop, removing the background if possible, while retaining the rule(s), which I think you have used well here.  Perhaps a slight nudge rotation down on the right, not sure.  Also not sure on the frame, but I do not think it ''detracts''.  Good opportunity/timing.', '2005-09-22 01:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729652, 232995, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice action, good composion,</td>', 'nice action, good composion,', '2005-09-22 01:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729654, 232478, 28882, '<td valign="top">a little too dark to be interesting.</td>', 'a little too dark to be interesting.', '2005-09-22 01:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729657, 234564, 40484, '<td valign="top">perhaps a closer crop to bring the bird''s eye to the thirds focal point. nice clear shot of the bird</td>', 'perhaps a closer crop to bring the bird''s eye to the thirds focal point. nice clear shot of the bird', '2005-09-22 01:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729658, 232897, 28882, '<td valign="top">I think it needs to be cropped a little more on the left.</td>', 'I think it needs to be cropped a little more on the left.', '2005-09-22 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729659, 232655, 35444, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!</td>', 'Excellent capture!', '2005-09-22 01:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729660, 234532, 23107, '<td valign="top">Which intersection is the focal point?  I''m confused.</td>', 'Which intersection is the focal point?  I''m confused.', '2005-09-22 01:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729661, 231877, 28882, '<td valign="top">would like to see more detail in the foreground.  nice shoreline and horizon.</td>', 'would like to see more detail in the foreground.  nice shoreline and horizon.', '2005-09-22 01:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729664, 234125, 23107, '<td valign="top">Something is making this blurry right where the focal point is.  Otherwise nice frame.</td>', 'Something is making this blurry right where the focal point is.  Otherwise nice frame.', '2005-09-22 01:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729667, 234149, 28882, '<td valign="top">i like the tone and composition.  a little contrasty though.</td>', 'i like the tone and composition.  a little contrasty though.', '2005-09-22 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
