(1729683, 234175, 28882, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the yellow part is the main subject which is a little too centered.  nice image though</td>', 'I''m guessing the yellow part is the main subject which is a little too centered.  nice image though', '2005-09-22 01:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729685, 234651, 23107, '<td valign="top">You try to fix the color?  Otherwise this is a great frame.</td>', 'You try to fix the color?  Otherwise this is a great frame.', '2005-09-22 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729686, 231525, 28882, '<td valign="top">I think it was too dark to get a decent shot for this.  the redness and all the blurring doesn''t seem to work.</td>', 'I think it was too dark to get a decent shot for this.  the redness and all the blurring doesn''t seem to work.', '2005-09-22 02:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729689, 232835, 23107, '<td valign="top">Why is this choppy like that?</td>', 'Why is this choppy like that?', '2005-09-22 02:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729693, 232455, 23107, '<td valign="top">Everything seems to have an all around blur to it.</td>', 'Everything seems to have an all around blur to it.', '2005-09-22 02:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729695, 231489, 31720, '<td valign="top">I took the liberty of saving this photo and doing a simple levels adjustment (Black = 25, White = 186, Gamma = 0.90) and it made a world of difference.  Right now, this photo is quite lacking in contrast and has a very narrow tonal range (it consists of a very narrow range of shades of grey).  That there are no pure black and no brighter areas leaves the eye wondering where to look.  Increasing the contrast with levels gives shape to your subject (right now she looks very flat and two-dimensional) and brightens it to make it the focus of the photo.</td>', 'I took the liberty of saving this photo and doing a simple levels adjustment (Black = 25, White = 186, Gamma = 0.90) and it made a world of difference.  Right now, this photo is quite lacking in contrast and has a very narrow tonal range (it consists of a very narrow range of shades of grey).  That there are no pure black and no brighter areas leaves the eye wondering where to look.  Increasing the contrast with levels gives shape to your subject (right now she looks very flat and two-dimensional) and brightens it to make it the focus of the photo.', '2005-09-22 02:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729698, 233977, 23107, '<td valign="top">This image has a purple hazy cast in the background.</td>', 'This image has a purple hazy cast in the background.', '2005-09-22 02:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729701, 232302, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Really like this shot and the perspective/timing.  Good colors and background, and while no ''expert'', good use of the rule(s), especially for the eyes.  Criticism;  though I would like to see the entire wing span, difficult with this crop and ''opportunity''.  If it were a horizontal frame rather than vertical, who knows.  The detail in the bird is great, including the feathers, feet, but especially the eyes.  Just like to see all that ''enhanced'' more if possible, maybe contrast, not sure.  Good shot.</td>', '8 - Really like this shot and the perspective/timing.  Good colors and background, and while no ''expert'', good use of the rule(s), especially for the eyes.  Criticism;  though I would like to see the entire wing span, difficult with this crop and ''opportunity''.  If it were a horizontal frame rather than vertical, who knows.  The detail in the bird is great, including the feathers, feet, but especially the eyes.  Just like to see all that ''enhanced'' more if possible, maybe contrast, not sure.  Good shot.', '2005-09-22 02:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729710, 234054, 23107, '<td valign="top">Grass needs to be greener.</td>', 'Grass needs to be greener.', '2005-09-22 02:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729712, 232225, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like the border, background, composition and smile. More light on your model''s face would have really made this shot for me. I wouldn''t change anything else though it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I like the border, background, composition and smile. More light on your model''s face would have really made this shot for me. I wouldn''t change anything else though it''s a great shot.', '2005-09-22 02:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729714, 234280, 23107, '<td valign="top">The red chocolate needs to stand out more.</td>', 'The red chocolate needs to stand out more.', '2005-09-22 02:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729715, 234020, 23107, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot.</td>', 'Nice snapshot.', '2005-09-22 02:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729718, 234392, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition. I like how you can see into the water.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition. I like how you can see into the water.', '2005-09-22 02:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729723, 234587, 23107, '<td valign="top">The football is the point of interest, but there are three guys going for the guys legs and almost seems that is the point of interest.  The image draws you to both places at once making this look like a big mess initially.<br/> 4</td>', 'The football is the point of interest, but there are three guys going for the guys legs and almost seems that is the point of interest.  The image draws you to both places at once making this look like a big mess initially. 4', '2005-09-22 02:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729725, 233973, 21362, '<td valign="top">Wow, never saw one of those before. What a crazy flower! I like the perspective you used too... interesting photo.</td>', 'Wow, never saw one of those before. What a crazy flower! I like the perspective you used too... interesting photo.', '2005-09-22 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729726, 233256, 23107, '<td valign="top">Points of interest does not seem to have anything of interest.</td>', 'Points of interest does not seem to have anything of interest.', '2005-09-22 02:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729728, 232819, 39349, '<td valign="top">DOF could be better IMHO, I think this shot as more potential. Lighting seems a bit flat as well. 4</td>', 'DOF could be better IMHO, I think this shot as more potential. Lighting seems a bit flat as well. 4', '2005-09-22 02:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729730, 234297, 23107, '<td valign="top">Boat needs to be brighter if it is the point of interest.</td>', 'Boat needs to be brighter if it is the point of interest.', '2005-09-22 02:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729731, 232819, 21362, '<td valign="top">? I don''t understand this one.</td>', '? I don''t understand this one.', '2005-09-22 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729733, 232655, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Well composed. It''s a shame the colours blend in so much (Foreground and Background. Can''t do much about that within basic challenge rules though I guess.</td>', 'Great capture. Well composed. It''s a shame the colours blend in so much (Foreground and Background. Can''t do much about that within basic challenge rules though I guess.', '2005-09-22 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729734, 234553, 23107, '<td valign="top">Blurry.</td>', 'Blurry.', '2005-09-22 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729735, 232465, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great action shot</td>', 'Great action shot', '2005-09-22 02:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729736, 232501, 39349, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful candid shot. Meets the challenge, model''s hair seems a bit out of focus and Hue / Sat and maybe contrast bumped up a bit to bring out a bit more color might help this IMHO. Still I love it, and I hope it does well. 8</td>', 'Simple and beautiful candid shot. Meets the challenge, model''s hair seems a bit out of focus and Hue / Sat and maybe contrast bumped up a bit to bring out a bit more color might help this IMHO. Still I love it, and I hope it does well. 8', '2005-09-22 02:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729738, 234465, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color contrast, simple and elegant shot.</td>', 'Beautiful color contrast, simple and elegant shot.', '2005-09-22 02:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729742, 234564, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Criticism; whilst no ''expert'' in the rule(s), I would like to have seen this using a stricter sense of the rules, especially for the Challenge.  A tighter crop, or closer zoom, incorporating more (if possible) of the right of that rusted ''perch'', more detail in the feathers, would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  Like the colors and the background, just more definition on the bird, as you have in the ''perch''.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Criticism; whilst no ''expert'' in the rule(s), I would like to have seen this using a stricter sense of the rules, especially for the Challenge.  A tighter crop, or closer zoom, incorporating more (if possible) of the right of that rusted ''perch'', more detail in the feathers, would have made this a better shot in my opinion.  Like the colors and the background, just more definition on the bird, as you have in the ''perch''.', '2005-09-22 02:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729745, 234500, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay first off, I''m not a fan of this type of shot, the pussy(cat) stuff seems to be getting over done here as of late. BUT...this is a beautiful shot that is well composed and captured. Love the contrast and DOF. Good luck! 8</td>', 'Okay first off, I''m not a fan of this type of shot, the pussy(cat) stuff seems to be getting over done here as of late. BUT...this is a beautiful shot that is well composed and captured. Love the contrast and DOF. Good luck! 8', '2005-09-22 02:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729750, 232475, 21362, '<td valign="top">haha, they were definitely checking you out!<br/> <br/>I would''ve cropped a little tighter to get rid of the fence in the top right. I like to run my eyes all around the edges of the frame and make sure there aren''t any little distractions like that acting to pull the viewers eyes away from the subject.</td>', 'haha, they were definitely checking you out! I would''ve cropped a little tighter to get rid of the fence in the top right. I like to run my eyes all around the edges of the frame and make sure there aren''t any little distractions like that acting to pull the viewers eyes away from the subject.', '2005-09-22 02:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729751, 233918, 39349, '<td valign="top">Skin has a blue/green hue to it......shot meets challenge; I like the setup of the shot. The post processing is hurting you here IMHO. 4</td>', 'Skin has a blue/green hue to it......shot meets challenge; I like the setup of the shot. The post processing is hurting you here IMHO. 4', '2005-09-22 02:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729756, 234628, 31720, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  I agree that the water line should be centered since it enhances the symmetry of the building and its reflection.  However, this doesn''t leave you with much to follow the rule of thirds.  The trees do, but those aren''t a major element of the picture.  I would suggest cropping them out and leave the potted plants and their reflections at the four "rule of thirds intersection" points.</td>', 'Good picture.  I agree that the water line should be centered since it enhances the symmetry of the building and its reflection.  However, this doesn''t leave you with much to follow the rule of thirds.  The trees do, but those aren''t a major element of the picture.  I would suggest cropping them out and leave the potted plants and their reflections at the four "rule of thirds intersection" points.', '2005-09-22 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729757, 234103, 31720, '<td valign="top">You need much more contrast in this photo to brighten the statue so that it stands out from the background.  Show us its true colors.</td>', 'You need much more contrast in this photo to brighten the statue so that it stands out from the background.  Show us its true colors.', '2005-09-22 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729761, 233103, 31720, '<td valign="top">I''m going to ignore my knee-jerk response of "Does Not Meet Challenge" by assuming the bush is at the proper point and give this an 8.  Great picture.  Next time, the division between the white sand and the dark mountains should be a third of the height from the top of the frame.  Right now, the blank sky takes up too much room for so little interest.</td>', 'I''m going to ignore my knee-jerk response of "Does Not Meet Challenge" by assuming the bush is at the proper point and give this an 8.  Great picture.  Next time, the division between the white sand and the dark mountains should be a third of the height from the top of the frame.  Right now, the blank sky takes up too much room for so little interest.', '2005-09-22 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729765, 234468, 6393, '<td valign="top">nice picture just siple</td>', 'nice picture just siple', '2005-09-22 02:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1729766, 234156, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot, everything about it. Great use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Great shot, everything about it. Great use of the rule of thirds.', '2005-09-22 02:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
