(1731003, 232289, 40819, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it a pain when one street light is blown out when you shoot a night shot? I love what you have done here, I would suspect this was shot at a high f stop like 22 or so causing the star effects around the lights.<br/>This is a great shot only spolied by events not in your control. The only thing I would have suggested is cropping the picture ust to the right of the blue light, maybe right on the light pole with the burnt out light on it. <br/>nice sharp night shot. Good job.</td>', 'Isn''t it a pain when one street light is blown out when you shoot a night shot? I love what you have done here, I would suspect this was shot at a high f stop like 22 or so causing the star effects around the lights.This is a great shot only spolied by events not in your control. The only thing I would have suggested is cropping the picture ust to the right of the blue light, maybe right on the light pole with the burnt out light on it. nice sharp night shot. Good job.', '2005-09-22 15:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
