(1731438, 234368, 42984, '<td valign="top">Powerful image - must surely ribbon.  The birds are the difference between a strong image and a great one.  Ground line is spot on the horizontal thirds line, the left vertical is right through the dome by the look of it ... just shows that thirds works.  I''m betting this is Iceland yet again, having access to some of the best scenery certainly helps :)</td>', 'Powerful image - must surely ribbon.  The birds are the difference between a strong image and a great one.  Ground line is spot on the horizontal thirds line, the left vertical is right through the dome by the look of it ... just shows that thirds works.  I''m betting this is Iceland yet again, having access to some of the best scenery certainly helps :)', '2005-09-22 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
