(1731862, 233917, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this but, criticism; which it were not so high key, more contrast left on the critter.  The frame is too thick in my opinion and detracts, especially from the ''fragility'' of the critter.  Technically, while no ''expert'', looks spot on to me.  Just wish the vivid color shone through more boldly, and more detail too on the ''hairs''.</td>', '7 - I like this but, criticism; which it were not so high key, more contrast left on the critter.  The frame is too thick in my opinion and detracts, especially from the ''fragility'' of the critter.  Technically, while no ''expert'', looks spot on to me.  Just wish the vivid color shone through more boldly, and more detail too on the ''hairs''.', '2005-09-22 22:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731876, 234393, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Forgotten and ''obsolete''.  Great scene.  Criticism; more definition, or contrast, not sure.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), seems you have placed the "point of interest" (as a whole) fairly strictly, however, for me, my ''eye'' goes first to the ''head of the dragon'' so, if that were nudged a little more to the left, with some more space on the right, may have made this an even better shot in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Forgotten and ''obsolete''.  Great scene.  Criticism; more definition, or contrast, not sure.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), seems you have placed the "point of interest" (as a whole) fairly strictly, however, for me, my ''eye'' goes first to the ''head of the dragon'' so, if that were nudged a little more to the left, with some more space on the right, may have made this an even better shot in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-09-22 22:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731885, 233978, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this, a little ''contradictory''.  Criticism; not sure what that ''green'' is middle left, perhaps flare, not sure.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks to me like you covered two bases here; one intersection and one ''row''.  Like the title.  If the colors were a little more enhanced somehow, perhaps a little more definition in the landscape, and maybe clouds, not sure, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.</td>', '7 - I like this, a little ''contradictory''.  Criticism; not sure what that ''green'' is middle left, perhaps flare, not sure.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks to me like you covered two bases here; one intersection and one ''row''.  Like the title.  If the colors were a little more enhanced somehow, perhaps a little more definition in the landscape, and maybe clouds, not sure, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.', '2005-09-22 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731891, 232746, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  While no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks to me like good use of two intersections and the three ''rows'', so well done.  Criticism; Maybe a touch darker at the fore, not sure.  A little more definition, in the clouds and mountain tops, may have made this an even better shot.  Seems to be a little grain, so just to contradict that, maybe some softening, who knows.</td>', '7 - Nice.  While no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks to me like good use of two intersections and the three ''rows'', so well done.  Criticism; Maybe a touch darker at the fore, not sure.  A little more definition, in the clouds and mountain tops, may have made this an even better shot.  Seems to be a little grain, so just to contradict that, maybe some softening, who knows.', '2005-09-22 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731901, 232838, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Criticism; wish the whole moth was in focus, though you have captured most of it very well, good definition.  The ''bokeh'' is nice, but the color of the flower detracts slightly in my opinion, or rather ''competes'' with the subtle coloring of the moth.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks pretty spot on to me, though I would loved to have seen the wings used as a ''top row'', etc, but that''s a totally different shot and indeed likely technique too, so who knows.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Criticism; wish the whole moth was in focus, though you have captured most of it very well, good definition.  The ''bokeh'' is nice, but the color of the flower detracts slightly in my opinion, or rather ''competes'' with the subtle coloring of the moth.  Technically, while no ''expert'' in the rule(s), looks pretty spot on to me, though I would loved to have seen the wings used as a ''top row'', etc, but that''s a totally different shot and indeed likely technique too, so who knows.', '2005-09-22 22:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
