(1733252, 234363, 42792, '<td valign="top">Great action take.   By the rule of thirds, the point of interest is where the surf board comes out from the waves which could have been pretty interesting.  Only problem is that I had to look harder for that ''coz the interest and focus at first glance is on the surfer''s face and body, overshadowing the point of this challenge.  Hope that makes sense.  Wondering if it wouldn''t have been more impactful in keeping with the challenge to re-frame the surfer a little to the third''s intersection on the right.</td>', 'Great action take.   By the rule of thirds, the point of interest is where the surf board comes out from the waves which could have been pretty interesting.  Only problem is that I had to look harder for that ''coz the interest and focus at first glance is on the surfer''s face and body, overshadowing the point of this challenge.  Hope that makes sense.  Wondering if it wouldn''t have been more impactful in keeping with the challenge to re-frame the surfer a little to the third''s intersection on the right.', '2005-09-23 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
