(1733505, 234502, 36299, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the photo and its overall balance .  The subject is perfectly placed and the surrounding area works nicely.  The colours are in harmonic opposition which I feel really makes the proper rule of thirds photograph.</td>', 'I like the composition of the photo and its overall balance .  The subject is perfectly placed and the surrounding area works nicely.  The colours are in harmonic opposition which I feel really makes the proper rule of thirds photograph.', '2005-09-23 13:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733510, 234550, 36299, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The only part that detracts for me is the shadow.</td>', 'Excellent.  The only part that detracts for me is the shadow.', '2005-09-23 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733518, 234084, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  This reminds of tigger.  The overall balance is very nice and th DOF is excellent.</td>', 'Nicely done.  This reminds of tigger.  The overall balance is very nice and th DOF is excellent.', '2005-09-23 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733525, 234496, 36299, '<td valign="top">Very interesting flower.  The background really enhances the appeal of this photograph for me.  It is a great example of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Very interesting flower.  The background really enhances the appeal of this photograph for me.  It is a great example of the rule of thirds.', '2005-09-23 13:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733532, 232920, 36299, '<td valign="top">The high contrast yellow plus the rule of thirds and the bluish stonework really make this photograph appealing to me.  To add the rule of thirds really makes this photograph work.</td>', 'The high contrast yellow plus the rule of thirds and the bluish stonework really make this photograph appealing to me.  To add the rule of thirds really makes this photograph work.', '2005-09-23 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733546, 232812, 36299, '<td valign="top">The body of the butterfly falls in the rule of thirds nicely.  The only big distractions are the flower behind the butterfly,  The dazzling clarity of the finger makes the butterfly look out of focus..</td>', 'The body of the butterfly falls in the rule of thirds nicely.  The only big distractions are the flower behind the butterfly,  The dazzling clarity of the finger makes the butterfly look out of focus..', '2005-09-23 13:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733579, 234017, 36299, '<td valign="top">Although a great photograph, it is not really rule of thirds.  The main focus of the picture must fall within the bisection of the lines that divide the image.  A shallower DOF would of allowed you to move the main  focus of the photo to one of those bisecting points.<br/> <br/>Now forgetting about the rule of thirds here, you did an excellent job of getting this close to the hopper.  It is a wonderful photo full of colour and contrast.</td>', 'Although a great photograph, it is not really rule of thirds.  The main focus of the picture must fall within the bisection of the lines that divide the image.  A shallower DOF would of allowed you to move the main  focus of the photo to one of those bisecting points. Now forgetting about the rule of thirds here, you did an excellent job of getting this close to the hopper.  It is a wonderful photo full of colour and contrast.', '2005-09-23 13:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733609, 234283, 17203, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, focus and color. The Rule of Thirds is evident, but relatively subtle... it''s not really a strong aspect of the photo, and I suspect you wouldn''t use this shot to illustrate the principle. So, yes, it meets the challenge, but the rule of thirds doesn''t exactly play a lead role. The girl is cute and colorful, but the disinterested expression will hold your score back because there''s not enough of the face or personality showing to really engage the viewer.</td>', 'Excellent exposure, focus and color. The Rule of Thirds is evident, but relatively subtle... it''s not really a strong aspect of the photo, and I suspect you wouldn''t use this shot to illustrate the principle. So, yes, it meets the challenge, but the rule of thirds doesn''t exactly play a lead role. The girl is cute and colorful, but the disinterested expression will hold your score back because there''s not enough of the face or personality showing to really engage the viewer.', '2005-09-23 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1733633, 234368, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not voting on this challenge but this shot was pointed out to me by a friend and I totally agree with him, it´s freaking awesome!  If I were voting it would have gotten a 10 from me and I added it to my favorites.  There is absolutely nothing I dislike about it (except the dust spots of course but I know you would have cleaned them up if this wasn´t a basic challenge).</td>', 'I am not voting on this challenge but this shot was pointed out to me by a friend and I totally agree with him, it´s freaking awesome!  If I were voting it would have gotten a 10 from me and I added it to my favorites.  There is absolutely nothing I dislike about it (except the dust spots of course but I know you would have cleaned them up if this wasn´t a basic challenge).', '2005-09-23 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
