(1734017, 232806, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>You have a lot of what is usually jpg compression artifacts.  You may be compressing too high, your file size is only 29k so you had room to go.  Try little amounts of compression at a time.  There is some threads in the forums about this if need be.  Your colors also seem a little dull, check if a slight curve adjustment can get you a better sky or see about a circular polizer.  Very nice placement of the subject though, you''re right on with this.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  You have a lot of what is usually jpg compression artifacts.  You may be compressing too high, your file size is only 29k so you had room to go.  Try little amounts of compression at a time.  There is some threads in the forums about this if need be.  Your colors also seem a little dull, check if a slight curve adjustment can get you a better sky or see about a circular polizer.  Very nice placement of the subject though, you''re right on with this.', '2005-09-23 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
