(1734041, 232107, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>Not sure what happend but you seem to have a lot of pink and white blocks from jpg compression in the background, usually from too much compression.  Did you save and compress often or just a lot at once.  I would recommend doing it in small amounts only after you are done editing, save as something lossless like TIFF till you are done then save for web or compress.  Good high key image.<br/></td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  Not sure what happend but you seem to have a lot of pink and white blocks from jpg compression in the background, usually from too much compression.  Did you save and compress often or just a lot at once.  I would recommend doing it in small amounts only after you are done editing, save as something lossless like TIFF till you are done then save for web or compress.  Good high key image.', '2005-09-23 17:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
