(1734129, 234590, 41504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in this image!  The damsel fly grabs the attention.  With it had more detail in it but its a nice shot!</td>', 'Beautiful colors in this image!  The damsel fly grabs the attention.  With it had more detail in it but its a nice shot!', '2005-09-23 17:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
