(1734131, 234410, 41504, '<td valign="top">Great entry, meets the challenge.  I see a sharpening halo over the landscape.</td>', 'Great entry, meets the challenge.  I see a sharpening halo over the landscape.', '2005-09-23 17:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734133, 234392, 41504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful with all the shades of blue...really nice presentation</td>', 'Beautiful with all the shades of blue...really nice presentation', '2005-09-23 17:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734134, 234483, 41504, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  meets the challenge, well done!</td>', 'Very cool image!  meets the challenge, well done!', '2005-09-23 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734136, 234550, 41504, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, with the light was just a touch softer but it meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'Really nice image, with the light was just a touch softer but it meets the challenge very well.', '2005-09-23 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734140, 234539, 43031, '<td valign="top">I think you gave the photograph good tension by facing the subject out of the frame, leaves you wondering what she''s waiting for. <br/> <br/>I would have preferred her a little to the left. Also, I''ve read (and notifced more sinc reading it) that facing objects to the left creates more tension. I tried it on this picture, and it changes from waiting for a friend and bored, to waiting to go into a hospital room or something more forebodeing.<br/> <br/>I like the tonal range, and how the flattened but still textured wall (or whatever leads your eye to her. Nice use of negative space. Move her a little center, and facing left and I really like this much better.</td>', 'I think you gave the photograph good tension by facing the subject out of the frame, leaves you wondering what she''s waiting for.  I would have preferred her a little to the left. Also, I''ve read (and notifced more sinc reading it) that facing objects to the left creates more tension. I tried it on this picture, and it changes from waiting for a friend and bored, to waiting to go into a hospital room or something more forebodeing. I like the tonal range, and how the flattened but still textured wall (or whatever leads your eye to her. Nice use of negative space. Move her a little center, and facing left and I really like this much better.', '2005-09-23 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734144, 234341, 39664, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened and the hue of the sky looks too saturated against the rock. Nice rule of thirds but technically (post processing) is overdone.</td>', 'Oversharpened and the hue of the sky looks too saturated against the rock. Nice rule of thirds but technically (post processing) is overdone.', '2005-09-23 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734145, 234368, 41504, '<td valign="top">So many things to like about this image!  Its a nice shot, strong diagonal &amp; the building draws attention immediately!</td>', 'So many things to like about this image!  Its a nice shot, strong diagonal & the building draws attention immediately!', '2005-09-23 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734147, 234596, 41504, '<td valign="top">Well done image, I like the sepia effect, suits the image very well.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Well done image, I like the sepia effect, suits the image very well.  Meets the challenge.', '2005-09-23 17:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734148, 233038, 39664, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems to be on the outside left flower pedal leaving the rest of the flower soft.  Nice leading line from the grass ...just wish the flower were more crisp.</td>', 'Your focus seems to be on the outside left flower pedal leaving the rest of the flower soft.  Nice leading line from the grass ...just wish the flower were more crisp.', '2005-09-23 17:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
