(1734302, 233816, 39664, '<td valign="top">Sweet and sweet!  There isn''t anything hot about a red bell pepper!  But, on to the photo....colors are pretty, maybe a tad oversharpened.  Comp is good and technically sound, except for the hot spots which you couldn''t do anything with, except reshoot because this is basic editing,  6</td>', 'Sweet and sweet!  There isn''t anything hot about a red bell pepper!  But, on to the photo....colors are pretty, maybe a tad oversharpened.  Comp is good and technically sound, except for the hot spots which you couldn''t do anything with, except reshoot because this is basic editing,  6', '2005-09-23 19:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
