(1734365, 232920, 43115, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  The color is so vibrant in this image.  Very clearly meets the challenge.  The shadow behind the leaf is perfect.<br/>What could be better with this image?  The hair/crack/whatever just above and to the left of the leaf is distracting.  The rest of the "schmutz" in the cracks is OK, but I think the picture would be a little better without it.  I would love to know if you just happend upon this or set it up.<br/>Excellent job!  A very strong 9.</td>', 'Outstanding!  The color is so vibrant in this image.  Very clearly meets the challenge.  The shadow behind the leaf is perfect.What could be better with this image?  The hair/crack/whatever just above and to the left of the leaf is distracting.  The rest of the "schmutz" in the cracks is OK, but I think the picture would be a little better without it.  I would love to know if you just happend upon this or set it up.Excellent job!  A very strong 9.', '2005-09-23 19:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734366, 232478, 43569, '<td valign="top">foreground is a bit too dark for me but nice scene none the less</td>', 'foreground is a bit too dark for me but nice scene none the less', '2005-09-23 19:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734372, 234189, 43115, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you''re going for here, with the subject squarely on the right third line.  However, there''s too much other stuff in the picture to really keep one''s eyes directly on that spot.  I''m also not sure I like the saturation/color washing that you did.  As a whole I think that technique is overused, and really needs to add something to the picture to make it effective.  That doesn''t happen for me here.<br/>The subject itself could have made an interesting study, if he was willing to cooperate.</td>', 'I think I see what you''re going for here, with the subject squarely on the right third line.  However, there''s too much other stuff in the picture to really keep one''s eyes directly on that spot.  I''m also not sure I like the saturation/color washing that you did.  As a whole I think that technique is overused, and really needs to add something to the picture to make it effective.  That doesn''t happen for me here.The subject itself could have made an interesting study, if he was willing to cooperate.', '2005-09-23 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734377, 234095, 43569, '<td valign="top">Sky looks somewhat over processed... otherwise I like this photo alot</td>', 'Sky looks somewhat over processed... otherwise I like this photo alot', '2005-09-23 19:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1734378, 232781, 43115, '<td valign="top">This picture perfectly meets the challenge, great job with the composition.<br/>DOF is really too shallow, I''d like to see all of the bug in focus as well as a little of whatever it is he''s standing on, otherwise it''s just too abstract.<br/>Interesting critter though!</td>', 'This picture perfectly meets the challenge, great job with the composition.DOF is really too shallow, I''d like to see all of the bug in focus as well as a little of whatever it is he''s standing on, otherwise it''s just too abstract.Interesting critter though!', '2005-09-23 19:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
