(1734491, 234181, 41504, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like the sepia tones.  I wish the whites weren''t overexposed.  Has that old fashion feel to it.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like the sepia tones.  I wish the whites weren''t overexposed.  Has that old fashion feel to it.', '2005-09-23 20:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
