(1734501, 234020, 41504, '<td valign="top">Good action capture &amp; it meets the challenge.  its a very flat image, perhaps a levels or contrast adjustment would bring it to life!</td>', 'Good action capture & it meets the challenge.  its a very flat image, perhaps a levels or contrast adjustment would bring it to life!', '2005-09-23 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
