(1734512, 234123, 41504, '<td valign="top">Cute pup!  The lighting is difficult in this and while the bright side is slightly too bright, its a bit too dark on the shadow side, while you couldn''t do it for the challenge, some selective adjustments would balance the lighting some.    I like the comp.</td>', 'Cute pup!  The lighting is difficult in this and while the bright side is slightly too bright, its a bit too dark on the shadow side, while you couldn''t do it for the challenge, some selective adjustments would balance the lighting some.    I like the comp.', '2005-09-23 21:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
