(1736621, 231893, 43115, '<td valign="top">Not a clear enough response to the challenge criteria for me.  A cute picture, and technically sound, but not very relevant.</td>', 'Not a clear enough response to the challenge criteria for me.  A cute picture, and technically sound, but not very relevant.', '2005-09-25 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1736644, 234632, 43115, '<td valign="top">This is another photo that awesomely captures the point behind the challenge.  Many photos are examples of the ROT, this one IS the ROT.  Good job.  Nice and sharp, good contrast.<br/>Gripe?  Only one.  The super reflectivity of the marbles isREALL distracting.  Instead of cleanly going across the lines of the ROT, I''m drawn to staring at the marbles and trying to figure out what''s being reflected in them.  I have no idea how to fix that other than dulling spray, and I have no idea how effective it would be, but that''s what''s keeping this from being a 10.<br/>Great submission!</td>', 'This is another photo that awesomely captures the point behind the challenge.  Many photos are examples of the ROT, this one IS the ROT.  Good job.  Nice and sharp, good contrast.Gripe?  Only one.  The super reflectivity of the marbles isREALL distracting.  Instead of cleanly going across the lines of the ROT, I''m drawn to staring at the marbles and trying to figure out what''s being reflected in them.  I have no idea how to fix that other than dulling spray, and I have no idea how effective it would be, but that''s what''s keeping this from being a 10.Great submission!', '2005-09-25 00:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1736649, 234638, 43115, '<td valign="top">Very nice example of the ROT, good entry for the challenge.<br/>The colors in the sky are a little dull for me, I wish they "popped" a little more.  The detail in te foreground is really good.  The lines of the mountain lead the eye RIGHT to a ROT intersection, which is perfect.</td>', 'Very nice example of the ROT, good entry for the challenge.The colors in the sky are a little dull for me, I wish they "popped" a little more.  The detail in te foreground is really good.  The lines of the mountain lead the eye RIGHT to a ROT intersection, which is perfect.', '2005-09-25 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1736650, 232819, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, although your points do seem to intersect the rule of thirds, I wish there was a bit more focus or clarity. Perhaps you were trying to make a graphic-like image?</td>', 'For me, although your points do seem to intersect the rule of thirds, I wish there was a bit more focus or clarity. Perhaps you were trying to make a graphic-like image?', '2005-09-25 01:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1736656, 234278, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a little too harsh and compared to other entries in the challenge, your chosen subject matter doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a little too harsh and compared to other entries in the challenge, your chosen subject matter doesn''t hold my interest.', '2005-09-25 01:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1736659, 233933, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you held this in your hand as it looks a bit...shaky. A tripod or maybe a ledge to rest the camera on will help with the stabilization and give you better results.</td>', 'I wonder if you held this in your hand as it looks a bit...shaky. A tripod or maybe a ledge to rest the camera on will help with the stabilization and give you better results.', '2005-09-25 01:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
