(1737815, 234040, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there was a bit more contrast or the shadows weren''t as heavy as it''s a sweet photo. If her head was turned slightly more towards the viewer it would have helped also. (Although I realize kids don''t like to cooperate in that way) :-)</td>', 'For me, I wish there was a bit more contrast or the shadows weren''t as heavy as it''s a sweet photo. If her head was turned slightly more towards the viewer it would have helped also. (Although I realize kids don''t like to cooperate in that way) :-)', '2005-09-25 19:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737817, 232568, 41675, '<td valign="top">The flash is a little to harsh for my tastes, but a nice closeup.</td>', 'The flash is a little to harsh for my tastes, but a nice closeup.', '2005-09-25 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737818, 233909, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I draw the imaginery thirds grid on your photo, the intersecting points fall in kind of "flat" places for me - compared to other entries in the challenge. It''s a nice architectural photo though, and I like the color treatment.</td>', 'When I draw the imaginery thirds grid on your photo, the intersecting points fall in kind of "flat" places for me - compared to other entries in the challenge. It''s a nice architectural photo though, and I like the color treatment.', '2005-09-25 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737820, 234340, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up after second look. I like the eeriness of the fog and good greens - not overblown.</td>', 'Bumping up after second look. I like the eeriness of the fog and good greens - not overblown.', '2005-09-25 19:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737823, 234553, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I mentally divide your photo into an equal tic-tac-toe grid, the intersecting points of interest fall into the sky and water. Also, the photo looks more pixelated compared to other entries in the challenge. It might have better impact if that sailboat was a bit higher and further into the photo. Good concept though.</td>', 'When I mentally divide your photo into an equal tic-tac-toe grid, the intersecting points of interest fall into the sky and water. Also, the photo looks more pixelated compared to other entries in the challenge. It might have better impact if that sailboat was a bit higher and further into the photo. Good concept though.', '2005-09-25 19:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737825, 232319, 41675, '<td valign="top">While this does fall into the rule of thirds, I find the color of the flowers themselves almost...blinding and...unreal. Perhaps too overly saturated?</td>', 'While this does fall into the rule of thirds, I find the color of the flowers themselves almost...blinding and...unreal. Perhaps too overly saturated?', '2005-09-25 19:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737826, 233353, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo seems a little grainy on my screen, but I like the blue of the water and the white of the duck.</td>', 'Your photo seems a little grainy on my screen, but I like the blue of the water and the white of the duck.', '2005-09-25 19:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737831, 232338, 41675, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what those plants are, but they are interesting. Compared to some of the others in the challenge the intersecting points fall a bit shy of the rule of thirds for me (although I am certainly no expert). I like the lighting and subdued background.</td>', 'I have no clue what those plants are, but they are interesting. Compared to some of the others in the challenge the intersecting points fall a bit shy of the rule of thirds for me (although I am certainly no expert). I like the lighting and subdued background.', '2005-09-25 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737833, 234423, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumbping up after second look. Nice blue coloring on the car. Too bad the little one isn''t smiling or looking at the viewer.</td>', 'Bumbping up after second look. Nice blue coloring on the car. Too bad the little one isn''t smiling or looking at the viewer.', '2005-09-25 19:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737834, 232774, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and setup, but the lights seems a bit strong to my untrained eyes.</td>', 'Nice composition and setup, but the lights seems a bit strong to my untrained eyes.', '2005-09-25 19:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737835, 232861, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wish the photo itself were larger, and while it does fall into the rule of thirds, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as much as other entries in the challenge.</td>', 'I wish the photo itself were larger, and while it does fall into the rule of thirds, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as much as other entries in the challenge.', '2005-09-25 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737838, 234164, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I draw the rule of third grids on your photo, the intersecting lines fall into the water, and thus lack interest. I do like your composition, but for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge as well as other entries.</td>', 'When I draw the rule of third grids on your photo, the intersecting lines fall into the water, and thus lack interest. I do like your composition, but for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge as well as other entries.', '2005-09-25 19:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737839, 234656, 41675, '<td valign="top">While the pole falls into the rule of thirds, for me, the main interest is the bird in the lower left. Also, I find the large black border a bit overwhelming. Perhaps just a one or two point border would be more effective - or try choosing a color from within the photo such as the sandy brown.</td>', 'While the pole falls into the rule of thirds, for me, the main interest is the bird in the lower left. Also, I find the large black border a bit overwhelming. Perhaps just a one or two point border would be more effective - or try choosing a color from within the photo such as the sandy brown.', '2005-09-25 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737842, 232387, 41675, '<td valign="top">Adding a point after a second look. I like the desaturated color on the girls skirt and socks.</td>', 'Adding a point after a second look. I like the desaturated color on the girls skirt and socks.', '2005-09-25 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737845, 232884, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I divide this photo into a grid, the intersecting points of interest fall into the sky, and to me, it does not meet the challenge. I do however like the sense of space you''ve created. That the world seems like a small place.</td>', 'When I divide this photo into a grid, the intersecting points of interest fall into the sky, and to me, it does not meet the challenge. I do however like the sense of space you''ve created. That the world seems like a small place.', '2005-09-25 19:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737846, 233256, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good colors, adding a point after second look.</td>', 'Good colors, adding a point after second look.', '2005-09-25 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737848, 233966, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not very technically inclined, but the trees in the foreground seem somehow odd color wise to my untrained eyes. I like the moon and the clouds, but again, there''s just something about those trees I can''t quite put my finger on.</td>', 'I''m not very technically inclined, but the trees in the foreground seem somehow odd color wise to my untrained eyes. I like the moon and the clouds, but again, there''s just something about those trees I can''t quite put my finger on.', '2005-09-25 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737850, 234267, 41675, '<td valign="top">With a bit more focus and clarity (I like crisp photos) I would have scored this higher. I like the overall colors.</td>', 'With a bit more focus and clarity (I like crisp photos) I would have scored this higher. I like the overall colors.', '2005-09-25 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
