(1738841, 234408, 31720, '<td valign="top">I would have picked a different title; maybe something that references H.P. Lovecraft''s "island in a sea of ignorance" or Nietzsche''s "When you stare into the abyss."  But that''s just me being morbid.<br/> <br/>Oh right!  The picture:  I like it  Getting the water and sky closer to an inky black would have made it perfect in my opinion, but again, I like stark pictures. 7</td>', 'I would have picked a different title; maybe something that references H.P. Lovecraft''s "island in a sea of ignorance" or Nietzsche''s "When you stare into the abyss."  But that''s just me being morbid. Oh right!  The picture:  I like it  Getting the water and sky closer to an inky black would have made it perfect in my opinion, but again, I like stark pictures. 7', '2005-09-26 03:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
