(1740946, 234463, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>While this could be a good image your sky ends up ruining it.  It is difficult to shoot from the shade into the sun, most cameas have a bracket function, check it out and see if a different exposure and maybe a flash could have helped this.   A circular polerizer may also helped reduce the brightness too.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  While this could be a good image your sky ends up ruining it.  It is difficult to shoot from the shade into the sun, most cameas have a bracket function, check it out and see if a different exposure and maybe a flash could have helped this.   A circular polerizer may also helped reduce the brightness too.', '2005-09-26 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
