(1741003, 232819, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>My first comment was going to be WOW BLURRY and totally centered, but then I thought maybe it was the edge in the foreground that is supposed to be the main focus.  It looks like you effectively used the depth of filed but I think this would have been more clear had the lighting been more on the front instead of towards the back or the blue thing was a lighter color that didn''t get lost in the front shadow.  Good attempt, hope I was able to help some.<br/></td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  My first comment was going to be WOW BLURRY and totally centered, but then I thought maybe it was the edge in the foreground that is supposed to be the main focus.  It looks like you effectively used the depth of filed but I think this would have been more clear had the lighting been more on the front instead of towards the back or the blue thing was a lighter color that didn''t get lost in the front shadow.  Good attempt, hope I was able to help some.', '2005-09-26 23:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
