(1744588, 234175, 41185, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for voting for me and especially those of you that took the time to comment.  This is my first challenge so I guess 185 out of 352 entries is not all that bad.  You all pointed out something that I did not notice so this is a learning experience.  I looked at the flower as the whole POV, but voters saw the flower center as the POV.  I will take that lesson to heart and look at my photos differently.  Again, thank you all again.<br/>Kathleeen<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for voting for me and especially those of you that took the time to comment.  This is my first challenge so I guess 185 out of 352 entries is not all that bad.  You all pointed out something that I did not notice so this is a learning experience.  I looked at the flower as the whole POV, but voters saw the flower center as the POV.  I will take that lesson to heart and look at my photos differently.  Again, thank you all again.Kathleeen', '2005-09-28 07:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
