(1744742, 234527, 37719, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this was yours...beautiful shot!  I like the slight green from the moss on the rocks and the splash of color at the top.  Good exposure length as well.  Nice job!</td>', 'I had a feeling this was yours...beautiful shot!  I like the slight green from the moss on the rocks and the splash of color at the top.  Good exposure length as well.  Nice job!', '2005-09-28 09:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
