(1744761, 234483, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this, however, I like your outtake <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=235182" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21362/thumb/235182.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21362/thumb/235182.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21362/thumb/235182.jpg"/></a> better.  The outtake IMO is more natural (orientation of the shell) and a bit brighter. Plus I like the appearance of sand in the outtake.  The lighting on your entry is low and leaves the top back side of the shell a little dark.<br/> <br/>The concept is wonderful and I think you have a winning idea here that could do well in print sales.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I like this, however, I like your outtake  better.  The outtake IMO is more natural (orientation of the shell) and a bit brighter. Plus I like the appearance of sand in the outtake.  The lighting on your entry is low and leaves the top back side of the shell a little dark. The concept is wonderful and I think you have a winning idea here that could do well in print sales.  Keep up the good work!', '2005-09-28 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
