(1744888, 234583, 30881, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very good entry. i gave it an ''8'' and expected it to be up in the top 20. Now that I see your age I am amazed at the professional artistic abilities that you have for such a young person. Very Good!! Don''t get discouraged, you have fantastic potential and will someday be in high demand. Congratulations!!</td>', 'I thought this was a very good entry. i gave it an ''8'' and expected it to be up in the top 20. Now that I see your age I am amazed at the professional artistic abilities that you have for such a young person. Very Good!! Don''t get discouraged, you have fantastic potential and will someday be in high demand. Congratulations!!', '2005-09-28 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
