(1749626, 234527, 34562, '<td valign="top">I have been here! How exciting. I recognized it immediately. I grew up in Monterey. I have been through the gorge top to bottom at least 30 times have even snuck in during the winter. Water looks a little low- must be pretty dry right now. Wish I had pictures of it then. Knowing where it is and the light, that is very scarce sometimes, this is an absolutely beautiful picture. I love the way the water looks. Great shot.</td>', 'I have been here! How exciting. I recognized it immediately. I grew up in Monterey. I have been through the gorge top to bottom at least 30 times have even snuck in during the winter. Water looks a little low- must be pretty dry right now. Wish I had pictures of it then. Knowing where it is and the light, that is very scarce sometimes, this is an absolutely beautiful picture. I love the way the water looks. Great shot.', '2005-09-30 00:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
