(1751528, 234617, 41574, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love your concept, your shot, and your self-criticisms. I honestly thought this was a "flag tablecloth," until I read what you had to say. Your noticing the ant''s being on red rather than white  and that phenomenon''s taking away from the ant  too, is quite shrewd. That said, no matter the "flaws," this is, indeed, a marvelous picture. Great work!</td>', 'I absolutely love your concept, your shot, and your self-criticisms. I honestly thought this was a "flag tablecloth," until I read what you had to say. Your noticing the ant''s being on red rather than white  and that phenomenon''s taking away from the ant  too, is quite shrewd. That said, no matter the "flaws," this is, indeed, a marvelous picture. Great work!', '2005-10-01 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
