(1762497, 232863, 27421, '<td valign="top">You commented on my awful coffee beans photo, so I always return the favor, usually to my delight.... this is a marvelous photo, very sharp, clear, in focus, and well composed. I live in Texas, and have seen such devices out west, where the wind is good for such... I just noticed though, no wires are connected, unless they are underground... sure makes it nice when they don''t foul up the scenery.... again, nice photo and thanks for your comments also.</td>', 'You commented on my awful coffee beans photo, so I always return the favor, usually to my delight.... this is a marvelous photo, very sharp, clear, in focus, and well composed. I live in Texas, and have seen such devices out west, where the wind is good for such... I just noticed though, no wires are connected, unless they are underground... sure makes it nice when they don''t foul up the scenery.... again, nice photo and thanks for your comments also.', '2005-10-05 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 0),
