(2410230, 233921, 51386, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this shot. I cant really say what it is but there also seems to be something missing... i know that sounds a lil contradictory now. I think id like to see a little more background. Perhaps if the shot was taken from a lower angle?</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this shot. I cant really say what it is but there also seems to be something missing... i know that sounds a lil contradictory now. I think id like to see a little more background. Perhaps if the shot was taken from a lower angle?', '2006-05-12 18:07:18.000000', NULL, 0),
